<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">- Nguu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">SAMWELI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu cha Nk'hongo cha Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc2">Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc3">Samweli</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu cha nk'hongo cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">SAMWELI</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOELO</para>
  <para style="ip">Aho nk'hongo vitabu va Samweli cha nk'hongo na cha kaidi vandaga ni kitabu kimwenga kikulu chamanyikaga enga, kitabu cha Samweli. Kitabu iki chapangwagwa kaidi mwo utapita we Kigiliki we Ndagano ya Nk'hongo. Mwo utapita uno we Kigiliki Kitabu cha nk'hongo cha Samweli na Kitabu cha kaidi cha Samweli, chetangwagwa, Useuta wa nk'hongo na wa kaidi, naho mwe Bibilia ye Kilatini vetangwagwa Maseuta wa nk'hongo na wa Kaidi hamwenga ne vitabu va Maseuta, vetengwagwa Maseuta wa katatu na maseuta wa kane. Vitabu va nk'hongo va Samweli, na vitabu va kaidi, vilongesa mwo wikazi wa mlotezi Samweli, seuta Sauli na seuta Daudi. Samweli niye andaga kilongozi azigiile mwo lupisi umwo Waizilaeli wasagukaga kulawa mwo kulongozwa ni walamuzi na kulongozwa ni maseuta. Naho Samweli awakumbaga mavuta Sauli na Daudi kunda maseuta waidi wa nk'hongo wa Izilaeli. Vitabu va nk'hongo va Samweli na vitabu va kaidi va Samweli vatambalisa Mbuli zomboke za Waizilaeli mwo lupisi ludya. Hehali yeyose ammanyaga uyo awandikaga vitabu ivo. Awandike haketambule mwenye mwe kitabu icho, mna ekalaga mpaka mwo lupisi lwa seuta Daudi, na lupisi lugendeele mpaka aho hawandikwagwa naho zimbuli za Sauli na Samweli. Kwajili ye kinyele mwa uyo muwandishi ywe vitabu ivi haimanyike kugamba vawandikwagwa ini.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani mwe kitabu cha Samweli ywa nk'hongo chalonga ukelekwa no lwitango lwa mlotezi Samweli. 2 Mnango wa 4-7 walongo ivo wafilisiti waditahaga Disanduku dye Ndagano kulawa kwa Waizilaeli na ivo yaletaga ubanangi mwe isi ya Wafilisiti umwo wandaga nadyo. 3 Mnango wa 8-15 walonga icho chalailaga umwo Waizilaeli walombezaga kunda na seuta niyo Samweli amkumba mavuta Sauli kunda seuta ywa nk'hongo, na ivo Zumbe Mnungu alemelaga Sauli. 4. Mnago wa 16-31 chalonga ivo Samweli amkumbaga Daudi kunda seuta ywa kaidi ywa Izilaeli, na ivo Sauli agezaga kumkoma Daudi. Atendaga ivo mpaka kwo uheelo wa ugima wakwe. Yemndani kitabu cha Samweli ywa kaidi 1 Mnango 1-5 walongo ivo Daudi andaga seuta ywa Yuda na akajika niyo anda Seuta ywa Izilaeli yose. 2 Mnango 6-10 walongo ivo Daudi ekalaga kunda seuta na kuwakoma wank'hondo wakwe wengi. 3 Mnago wa 11-12 chaona ivo Daudi atendaga uhabwasi na ukomi niyo ativilwa ni mlotezi Natani. 4 Mnango wa 13-20 chawaona awant'hu widi wasaguke kwa Daudi. 5 Mnango 22-24 Ihanganya zimbuli zose za Daudi mwo useuta wakwe.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Elikana ne kaya yakwe uko Shilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Kwandaga na mnt'hu yumwenga mwo mzi wa Lama mwe isi ye vigulu va Ifulaimu, zina dyakwe etangwagwa Elikana ywe dikabila dya Ifulaimu. Yehe andaga mwana ywa Yolohamu naho mwezukuluwe dya Elihu ywe mp'huga ya Tohu naho ni yumwenga mwo lukolo lwa Sufi. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Elikana andaga na wakaziwe waidi, yumwenga etangwagwa Hana ywa kaidi etangwagwa Penina, Penina andaga na wana, mna Hana andaga na wana. <verse eid="1SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Kila mwaka Elikana andaga akakwela kulawa mwo mzi wawe vileke wakavike na kumlavila nt'hambiko Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi kudya Shilo, uko Ofini na Fenehasi awo wana waidi wa Eli wandaga walavant'hambiko wa Zumbe. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Kila lupisi umwo Elikana akalava nt'hambiko, amwink'haga mkaziwe Penina manda imwenga ya nyama ya nt'hambiko na manda imwe imwe kwa kila mwana wa kilume na wakike. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Mna Elikana amwink'haga Hana manda nk'hulu kwaviya amuungisaga, hamwenga na kugamba Mnungu hamwink'haga cheleko. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Mna mke miyakwe, uyo Penina uyo miyakwe andaga akambela Hana na kumgela maya kwaviya Mnungu hamwink'haga cheleko. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Mbuli izi nezigendeela mwaka mpaka mwaka. Kila aho Hana akwelaga kwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, Penina agendeelaga kumbela. Hana andaga mnt'hu ywa kuila niyo alemela kudya nk'hande. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Elikana amuuzaga mkaziwe, “Hana wailai? Nii walemela ukudya? Naho nii una kinyulu mwo moyo wako? Togola miye hi ywedi kujink'ha wana mlongo we kilume?”<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hana na Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Zuwa dimwenga aho weze wabinde ukudya na kunywa mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mnungu uko Shilo. Hana niyo akimala mwo lupisi ulwo, mlavant'hambiko Eli andaga kekala mwe difumbi hagihi no mkola we Nyumba ya Mnungu. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Hana ailisaga kwa usungu na kumlombeza Zumbe. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />Naho aikaga kilapi akagamba, “Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi, uneva unanikaula miye mndima ywako niyo wanikumbukila na kunink'ha mwana kilume, niho nenimwink'hize kwa Zumbe kwa mazuwa yose yo wikazi wakwe naho fili zakwe hezimogwe kwaviya kalavigwa kwajili ya Zumbe.”<verse eid="1SA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Umwo Hana akagendeela kulombeza kwa Zumbe Mnungu, Eli andaga akaukaula mnomo wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Hana naakalombeza kwo moyo wakwe, milomo yakwe nayo yandaga ikazingiza, mna izwi dyakwe hedikevika, Eli afanyanyaga kugamba uyo mvele kakolwa, <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />niyo amgamba weye nounde mkozi mpaka ini, “Usekugendeela kuvata mp'hombe!”<verse eid="1SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Hana niyo amhitula, “Mkulu hiyo ivo, miye ni mvele nna kinyulu, miye hivatile mp'hombe, naho nehamlombeza Zumbe Mnungu hamgambila makunt'ho yangu, <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />usekugamba mndima ywako himvele kint'hu, miye nehalombeza ivi kwaajili ya makunt'ho yangu.”<verse eid="1SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Eli niyo amgamba, “Ita kwa utondowazi, Mnungu ywa Izilaeli akwink'he kiya ulombeze.”<verse eid="1SA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Hana niyo agamba, “Nakulombeza unifanyayile yedi.” Hana niyo akeitila, adyaga nk'hande, handile na kinyulu naho.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwelekwa kwa Samweli no kuikwa kwa ndima ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Zuwa ditimile kilokilo, Elikana ne mp'huga yakwe wagendaga kumvika Zumbe, weze wajike ukuvika wauyaga kwe kaya yawe uko Lama. Elikana agonaga na mkaziwe Hana, Zumbe Mnungu niyo amhitula ukulombeza kwakwe. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Ivo niyo Hana enula ubovu, no kwingila nyumba mwana kilume, niyo amwink'ha zina dyakwe Samweli, “Kwaviya amlombezaga mwana uyo kwa Zumbe.”<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Umwo Elikana akwelaga hamwenga ne mp'huga yakwe kwo kulava nt'hambiko ya kila mwaka kwa Zumbe Mnungu na kukint'hiza ikilapi kiya, <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Hana yehe haitaga. Mna amgamba mgosiwe, “Aho mwana akeza kuleka konk'ha, nenimwigale na kumwiika ha Zumbe Mnungu, naho neekale aho mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="1SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Elikana uyo mgosiwe niyo amgamba, “Haya damanya ivo ukuona ni vedi kwako, gojela mpaka mwana aleke ukonk'ha, Zumbe naatende kilapi chako kunda kindedi,” Ivo yudya mvele ekalaga kaya akamwonk'heza umwana mpaka aho alekaga konk'ha.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Yudya mwana eze aleke konk'ha, amwigalaga hamwenga na njeku ya miyaka mitatu, na nt'hangulu ya unga na kizembe cha divai, amwigalaga mwana uyo kwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mnungu uko Shilo. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Weze wajike kuchinja injeku niyo wamwigala uyo umwana kwa Eli. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Yudya mvele niyo amgamba Eli, “Enga ivo Zumbe ywangu akukutenda unde mgima, togola wanikumbukila? Miye ni yudya mvele wamuonaga kakimala aha akamlombeza Zumbe. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Namlombezaga anink'he umwana uyu, niyo Zumbe Mnungu anink'ha kiya nimlombeze. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Naivo elo namwink'hizaga umwana uyu kwa Zumbe Mnungu, mwo ugima wakwe wose naande ywa Zumbe.” Eze ajike kulonga ayo amvikaga Mnungu hadya.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Nt'hogola ya Hana kwa Zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Niyo Hana atogola akagamba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">“Moyo wangu wamwangila Zumbe Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">Nna kinyemi kitendese kwa yadya anitendele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">Nawaseka wank'hondo wangu kinyemi changu ni kikulu kwaviya Mnungu kanambiza.<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />Hahana akukile enga Zumbe ywetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:2">Hahana yeyose enga yehe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:2">Hahana mwamizi enga Mnungu ywetu.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />Lekeni kukeduvya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">Lekeni milosi yenyu ya weduvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">Kwaviya Zumbe niye Mnungu amanyize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">Naho ayasengela yose yakutendigwa ni want'hu<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />Nyuta za wata ludole zivunika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:4">Mna wasokezi wapata ludole.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Wadya wose wandaga na nk'hande imemile ndi wanda wasumi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Mna wadya wandaga na sala hawana sala naho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Mna yudya mvele mgumba kengila nyumba wana kilume wabindile wingi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Mna yudya andaga na wana wengi halekelwe hata yumwenga.<verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />Zumbe Mnungu akoma, naho, aleta ugima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:6">Awaseleza kwo mnyongomela na kuwavuza naho.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />Zumbe Mnungu awatenda wamwenga kunda wakiwa na wamwenga kunda wagoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:7">awaseleza wamwenga niyo watuhu awakweza.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Awenula wakiwa kulawa mwe luvumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">Awenula hewena kint'hu kulawa mwe makunt'ho yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">Awaika hamwenga na wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">Niyo awaika hant'hu ha nt'hogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">Kwaviya nk'hongelo ze isi ni za Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">Mwe zink'hongelo izo kazizenga isi izo zose.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />Aamila wikazi wa want'hu wakwe wahuwilwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">Mna want'hu wavu nawage mwo lwiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">Kwaviya mnt'hu hakupata uhumi kwa ludole lwakwe mwenye.<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />Wank'hondo wa Zumbe Mnungu nawabanangwe pele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">Naawatowe enga lukuwa kulawa kwe mbingu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">Zumbe Mnungu naaisengele isi yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">Neink'hize ludole kwa seuta ywakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">Naamongezele ludole seuta ywakwe kwa uyo amsagule.”<verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Niyo Elikana auya kaya uko Lama. Mna yudya mwana kilume Samweli ekalaga Shilo niyo anda mndima ywa Zumbe Mnungu akalongozwa ni Eli mlavant'hambiko.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Wana kilume wa Eli wandaga hi wahuwilwa. Hawamohohaga Zumbe Mnungu, <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />hegu hata mwe vint'hu ivo vaungagwa wenk'hige walavant'hambiko. Kila aho mnt'hu andaga akalava nt'hambiko yakwe mndima ywa mlavant'hambiko ezaga na uma una meno matatu, na umwo nyama ikei yatipwilika, <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />uyo mndima asomekaga uma uwo mndani mwe nyungu iyo, naho nyama yeyose ilavigwe umwo na uma uwo yandaga ya mlavant'hambiko, Waizilaeli wose waitaga Shilo kulavila nt'hambiko zawe uuko watendelagwa iivo. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Mna hata umwo mavuta ye nyama yandaga yakei kokigwa, mndima ywo mlavant'hambiko ezaga niyo amgamba yudya akulava nt'hambiko, “Mlavile mlavant'hambiko nyama ya kwanikwa kwaviya yehe haaguhe nyama itipwiliswe, mna naaguhe idya imbisi.”<verse eid="1SA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Uneva mnt'hu uyo anahitula akagamba, haya goja suwe kitende ivo viwagilwe naho kinde koka amavuta niho nouguhe idya ukuunga, mndima ywa mlavant'hambiko naagambe, “Bule nink'he ivi haluse, chaivo nohupokole.”<verse eid="1SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Wavu uno wa wabwanga wa Eli ukulisa ha Zumbe Mnungu, kwaviya wayatendelaga lubezo malavo ya Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samweli uko Shilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Mwo lupisi ulwo mbwanga Samweli andaga mndima kwa Zumbe Mnungu, yehe avalaga kizibao king'aile. <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Kila mwaka nine amsumilaga nk'hanzu ndodo niyo amwigaila mwanawe umwo yehe na mgosiwe wakakwela kugenda kulava nt'hambiko yawe ya kila mwaka. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Eli awavikilaga Elikana na mkaziwe akagamba, “Zumbe Mnungu naakwink'he wana watuhu mwo mvele uyu, hant'hu ha uyu yumwenga amlombezaga na kumwink'hiza kwa Zumbe.” Weze wajike kuvikilwa wauyaga kaya.<verse eid="1SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />Niyo Zumbe Mnungu amvikila Hana, niyo Hana apata wana kilume watatu na wakike waidi. Yudya mbwanga Samweli niyo akula akanda mndima ywa Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eli na wanawewe kilume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Mna Eli adahalisaga, niyo eva mbuli zose za wanawe we kilume ivo wawatendelaga Waizilaeli wose naivo wagendile na wavele wose nawakadamanya ndima he nk'hili ye Dihema dya Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Ivo niyo awagamba, “Nii mwadamanya mbuli enga izi? Neva mwa want'hu wose mwe zimbuli zo uwihi wenyu. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Lekeni zimbuli izi wanangu, kwaviya mbuli izi huziva kulawa kwa want'hu wa Zumbe Mnungu ziiha. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Uneva mnt'hu anamtendela wavu miyawe, mnt'hu adaha kumlombezela kuusilwa wavu kwa Mnungu, mna uneva mnt'hu anamtendela wavu Zumbe niani akudaha kumlombezela kuuswa wavu kwa Zumbe Mnungu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 2:25">Woho hawamtegeleze tati yawe kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu andaga kalamula kale kuwakoma.<verse eid="1SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Mbwanga Samweli agendeelaga kukula na kuungiswa ni Zumbe na want'hu.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulotezi mwe mp'huga ya Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Mnt'hu ywa Mnungu amwizilaga Eli niyo amgamba mkulu, “Zumbe Mnungu agamba ivi, nakakelaviliza mwe nyumba ya iso umwo mwandaga watumwa ywa Falao mwe isi ya Misili. <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Mwa makabila yose ya Izilaeli, namsagulaga iso ande mlavant'hambiko ywangu, anidamanyile ndima mwe kilingo changu, oke ubani naho wavale kizibau ho undiilo wangu. Naho nawenk'haga want'hu we mp'huga ya iso nyama zimwenga zandile zikalavigwa ni Waizilaeli kwa kokwa. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Woho nawazionela finju nt'hambiko zangu na malavo yangu ayo niwagambile want'hu wangu wanigaile? Eli nii kuwogohesa wanao kujink'ha miye kwa kukegimbaza wenye mwe zimanda zisagulwe za kila malavo zilavigwe ni want'hu wangu wa Izilaeli? <verse eid="1SA 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />Miye Zumbe Mnungu ywa Izilaeli, ‘Nalaganaga kugamba weye ne mp'huga yako no lukolo lwako kugamba nomnde wandima wangu enga walavant'hambiko wangu mazuwa yose.’ Mna haluse nagamba hevinde ivo naho, vituhu vakwe neniwatunye wose wakunitunya, wadya nawo wakunibela name neniwabele. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Tegeleza, lupisi lweza aho neniwakome wabwanga wose mwe mp'huga yako no lukolo lwako, vileke kusekunda na mnt'hu mwe mp'huga yako neekale mpaka kokudalahala kwakwe. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />Weye nounde na makunt'ho na finju umwo ukauwona uvikilwa uwo neniwenk'he want'hu watuhu wa Izilaeli, mna mwe mp'huga yako hokunde na yeyose akuunga agendeele kwikala mpaka adalahale. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Hata ivo nenisigaze yumwenga mwa welekwa wako kunda mgima, uyo naande mlavant'hambiko ywangu, mna naande nt'hunt'hu naho naaze makawiilo, naho welekwa wako wose nawakomwe kikwank'halu. <verse eid="1SA 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />Umwo wanawo waidi Ofini na Fenehasi wakabanika wose kwa zuwa dimwenga, ino neilagise kugamba kila kiya nilongile nekinde kindedi. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Miye mwenye neni kesaguile mlavant'hambiko mhuwilwa kwangu naadamanye kila kint'hu huunga adamanye. Nenimwink'he welekwa wakuunga wadamanye ndima mazuwa yose ha seuta ywangu asagulwe. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Mwelekwa ywenyu yeyose akuunga ande mgima naaungwe aite kwa mlavant'hambiko uyo na kumlombeza masawa na nk'hande, na kulombeza naho azumilwe kuwaambiza walavant'hambiko vileke apate cho kudya.”<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s1">Lwitango lwa Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Mwa mazuwa ayo umwo mbwanga Samweli akadamanya ndima ha Zumbe Mnungu akalongozwa ni Eli, kwandaga na milosi migeke kulawa kwa Zumbe Mnungu, Naho maona andaga akalagiswa ni Zumbe Mnungu yandilisaga mageke. <verse eid="1SA 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Zuwa dimwenga nekilo, Eli uyo andaga kadalahala naho meso yakwe yandaga yakonga kwaza ludole lwa kukaula, andaga kagona mwe chumba chakwe. <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />Vimuli va Mnungu vandaga mwo lwandaga lukei lwakweela, Samweli andaga kagona mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu aho dyandaga Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Mnungu. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Zumbe Mnungu amwitangaga Samweli, Samweli niyo etika, woe, longa mkulu. <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Agulukaga kwa Eli niyo amgamba, “Kunitanga, hiza”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:5">Mna Eli niyo amhitula, “Miye hikwitange ita ukagone” Ivo Samweli agendaga kugona.<verse eid="1SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />Zumbe niyo amwitanga Samweli naho, ivo enukaga niyo aita kwa Eli niyo amgamba, weye kunitanga miye hiza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:6">Mna Eli niyo amhitula, “Mwanangu hikwitange, uya ukagone”<verse eid="1SA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Samweli hamanyaga kugamba ni Zumbe Mnungu niye andaga akamwitanga, kwaviya Mnungu hanati alonge naye.<verse eid="1SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />Katatu naho Zumbe niyo amwitanga Samweli, Samweli niyo enuka na kuita kwa Eli na kumgamba, “Kunitanga, mie hiza,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:8">Eli niyo abunk'hula kugamba, Zumbe Mnungu niye andaga akamwitanga yudya mbwanga. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Ivo niyo amgamba, “Uya kagone, uneva anakwitanga naho, umgambe, ‘Longa Zumbe, mndima ywako akutegeleza.’” Ivo Samweli auyaga kwo kugona.<verse eid="1SA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Zumbe ezaga niyo akimala aho, niyo etanga enga viya nk'hongo, “Samweli, Samweli.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:10">Samweli niyo ahitula, “Longa mndima ywako nategeleza”<verse eid="1SA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo amgamba, “Kuna zuwa nenitende kint'hu cha kwitusa kwa want'hu wa Izilaeli, icho kila yumwenga naakiive neetuke. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Mwe dizuwa diya, nenitende kila kint'hu kiya nilongole kwe mp'huga ya Eli, kukongela nk'hongo mpaka kwo uheelo. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Nehimgambila kale kugamba imp'huga yako neniisengele vihile mazuwa yose kwaviya wanawe we kilume walonga mbuli ziihile kwangu. Eli amanyaga kugamba nawakadamanya ivo, mna hawalemeze. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Ivo nakelisa, mwe mp'huga ya Eli kugamba hahana nt'hambiko hegu malavo nayadahe kuusa masa yo wavu uno wihile mwe mp'huga ya Eli.”<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Samweli ekalaga mwo lusazi mpaka mtondo, enukaga niyo akomola zinyivi ze nyumba ya Zumbe Mnugu. Ogohaga kumgambila Eli yalongigwe ni Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Eli niyo amwitanga “Mwanangu Samweli.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:16">“Samweli niyo etika, woe mkulu.”<verse eid="1SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />“Eli amuuzaga Samweli, Zumbe Mnugu kakugambilai? Nakulombeza usekunifisa kint'hu chochose. Mnungu naakusengele vihile uneva hunanigambile kila kint'hu alongile na weye.” <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Ivo Samweli niyo amgambila kila kint'hu hasigaze kint'hu chochose, Eli niyo agamba, “Yehe niye Zumbe Mnungu naadamanye chochose kiya kikumwelela.”<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Samweli agendeelaga kukula, Zumbe Mnungu naye andaga hamwenga naye niyo ayadamanya yose amgambilaga kunda kindedi. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Ivo want'hu wose we isi ya Izilaeli kulawa Dani Kasikazini mpaka Beli Sheba ya Kusini wabunk'hulaga kugamba kindedi Samweli andaga mlotezi ywa Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />Zumbe Mnungu agendeelaga kukelaviliza uko Shilo, umwo amlailaga Samweli niyo alonga naye. Naho umwo Samweli andaga akalonga naye Waizilaeli wose wevaga.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Kutahigwa kwe Sanduku dye Ndagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Mbuli ya Zumbe yezaga kwa Samweli na Izilaeli yose. Mwo lupisi ludya Wafilisiti wakeduganyaga wakatowane na Waizilaeli, ivo Waizilaeli waikaga nk'hambi uko Ebenezeli, Wafilisiti nawo waikaga nk'hambi yawe uko Afeki. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Wafilisiti wakepangaga watowane na Wazilaeli. Umwo nk'hondo ize yenele Waizilaeli watowagwa ni Wafilisiti. Wakomagwa want'hu alufu nne kwe nk'hondo. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Want'hu weze wauye kulawa kwe nk'hondo, vilongozi wa Izilaeli wauzaga, “Nii Zumbe kawaleka wafilisiti wakitowe dyelo? Kiteni kikadiguhe Disanduku dye Ndagano kulawa Shilo, vileke ande hamwenga na suwe na kukiyokola kulawa kwa wank'hondo wetu.” <verse eid="1SA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Ivo watumaga wegalaga ulosi uko Shilo, niyo wadileta Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi uyo akwikala mnanga mwe viumbwa vina mawawa vikwitangwa Makelubi. Naho wadya wana waidi we kilume wa Eli, Ofini na Fenehasi waitaga wakanda ne Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Mnungu.<verse eid="1SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Sanduku dye Ndagano dya Zumbe dize dibule kwe nk'hambi, Waizilaeli wose wenulaga maizwi yawe vatendaga isi isingisike. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Wafilisiti weze weve ukwanga uko wauzaga, “Maizwi aya yose mwe nk'hambi ya Waibulania niyo imbwai?” Umwo weze wabunk'hule kugamba Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Zumbe Mnungu dibula mwe nk'hambi ya Waibulania. <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />Wafilisiti wogohaga niyo wagamba, “Milungu iza mwe nk'hambi yawe. Hangi suwe wenye, kint'hu enga iki hakinati kilaile kukongela nk'hongo! <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Hangi suwe wenye! Niani akuunga akiyokole kulawa umu mwe milungu ina udahi? Ino niyo milungu yawachinjaga Wamisili uko kwe dijangwa. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Wafilisiti mtoge naho mtowane kigosi, chaivo nomnde watumwa wa Waibulania, enga ivo woho weli watumwa wetu. Ivo towaneni kigosi.”<verse eid="1SA 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Wafilisiti nawatowana nk'hondo niyo wawahuma Waizilaeli. Waizilaeli awo wanyilikilaga kila yumwenga kwe kaya yakwe. Naho nokunda na ukomi mkulu watowani wa Izilaeli milongo mitatu alufu wakugenda lwa viga, wakomagwa. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Mnungu dyatahagwa, naho wana Eli Ofini na Fenehasi wose wakomagwa.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubanika kwa Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Mnt'hu yumwenga kulawa mwe dikabila dya Benjamini anyilikaga kulawa kwe nk'hondo mpaka Shilo niyo abula uuko mwe dizuwa idyo, kulagisa ikinyulu chakwe atatulaga zisuke zakwe niyo aketiila luvumbi mwo mtwi wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Mnt'hu uyo eze abule Eli andaga kekala mwe difumbi dyakwe mnk'handa mwe sila akagojela, kwaviya moyo wakwe nouzingiza kwaajili ye Disanduku dye Ndagano, mnt'hu yudya eze engile mwo mzi na kubwelekeza want'hu wose wo mzi wailaga. <verse eid="1SA 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Eli eze eve indilo auzaga, “Iyo ndilo yani?” Yudya mnt'hu asunguzaga kuita kwa Eli akamgambile. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />Eli andaga na miyaka milongo kenda na mnane, naho andaga nt'hunt'hu. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Yudya mnt'hu niyo agamba, “Miye hinyilika kulawa kwe nk'hondo niyo naguluka mpaka aha diyelo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:16">Eli niyo auza, “Mwanangu kulawahi?”<verse eid="1SA 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Yudya egale ulosi agambaga, “Waizilaeli wanyilika kulawa kwa Wafilisiti, nokunda na ukomi mkulu mwa suwe Waizilaeli, naho wanawo Ofini na Fenehasi wakomwa, Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Mnungu nadyo ditahigwa!”<verse eid="1SA 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Yudya mnt'hu eze atambule Disanduku dya Mnungu, Eli agwaga mangali kulawa mwe difumbi dyakwe dyandaga hagihi ne nk'hili. Andaga kadalahala naho andaga mnt'hu azamile, agwaga niyo agogojola isingo yakwe niyo abanika. Andaga mlamuzi ywa Izilaeli kwa miyaka milongo mine.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">File ya mkaza Fenehasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Mkamwana ywa Eli uyo mkaziwe dya Finehasi andaga mbovu, naho lwandaga ni lupisi lwakwe lwo kwingila nyumba nolubula, aho eze eve Disanduku dye Ndagano ditahigwa naho isevyala na mgosiwe wabanika, aaho niyo alumwa ni usungu niyo engila nyumba. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Umwo andile akabanika, wank'hunga wamgambaga “Usekogoha! Una mwana kilume.” Mna yehe hawevile naho hawahitule. <verse eid="1SA 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Mna dizina amwink'haga mwanawe dyandaga Ikabodi, Nuko kugamba, “Uwedi utendese wa Mnungu umlawa mwe Izilaeli.” Ni wkwa kutahigwa Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Mnungu ne file ya isevyala hamwenga ne file ya mgosiwe. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Niyo agamba, “Uwedi wa Mnungu utendese umlawa mwe Izilaeli kwaviya Disanduku dya Mnungu ditahigwa.”<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Sanduku dye Ndagano mwa Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Wafilisiti weze waditahe Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Mnungu, wadiguhaga kulawa Ebenezeli niyo waita nadyo Ashidodi, <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Wadigalaga Disanduku dya Mnungu niyo wadiika kwe nyumba hagihi ne dihili dikwitangwa Dagoni. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Want'hu wa Ashidodi weze wenuke kilokilo mwe dizuwa dya kaidi, waonaga hili dikwitangwa Dagoni digwa hasi mfunt'ha lomo aho he Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Zumbe, wamkimalisaga uyo Dagoni niyo wamwika hant'hu hakwe. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Mna kilokilo zuwa ditimile, waonaga hili dikwitangwa Dagoni digwa hasi mfunt'ha lomo naho aho he Disandugu dye Ndagano dya Zumbe, mtwi wakwe ne mikono yakwe vabogozokaga niyo vatomoka hasi he kisisilango, umwili wakwe nuwo wasigalaga du. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Ivi nivo vikuleka walavant'hambiko wa Dagoni na want'hu wosee wakwingila mwe nyumba ya kumvika Dagoni uko Ashidodi hawakujata he kisisilango.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />Zumbe Mnungu awasengelaga vihile want'hu wa Ashidodi na kuwatisa. Awasengelaga vihile woho na want'hu watuhu wa mgihi nawo kwa kuwegaila manyonge ya maihu makulu. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Wakaya wa Ashidodi weze waone ayo yalaile niyo wagamba, “Disanduku dya Mnungu ywa Izilaeli dise kwikala aha kwaviya udahi wakwe wakisulumiza suwe na Dagoni mnungu ywetu .” <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Ivo watumaga wegala ulosi niyo wawaduganyaga hamwenga maseuta wose washano wa Filisiti na kuwauza, “Nekitende vivihi ne Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Mnungu ywa Izilaeli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:8">Wadya maseuta niyo wahitula, “Digaleni uko Gati,” Ivo wadigalaga uko Gati kwo mzi mtuhu wa Wafilisiti.<verse eid="1SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Disanduku idyo dize dibule uko gati Zumbe awasengelaga vihile mzi uwo nawo, niyo awatenda wogohese naho awasulumizaga kwa maihu ayo yenelaga mwa want'hu wose wo mzi, kukongela wadodo mpaka wakulu. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Ivo wadigalaga Disanduku dye Ndagano uko Ekuloni mzi mtuhu wa Wafilisiti, mna dize dibule uko want'hu wailaga wakagamba, “Wegala Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Mnungu ywa Izilaeli aha, vileke wakikome suwe chose.” <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Ivo wawetangaga hamwenga wakulu wose wa Wafilisiti niyo wagamba, “Diuseni Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Mnungu ywa Izilaeli, diuye hant'hu hakwe vileke sema dinakikome suwe hegu want'hu wetu.” Kwandaga na wogohi mwo mzi wose kwaviya Mnungu nakawasulumizisa. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Wadya wandaga hawabanike wahotaga maihu niyo ndilo yawe yabula mpaka kulanga.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ukuvuzwa kwe Disanduku dye Ndagano uko Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Zumbe dyekalaga mwe isi ya Wafilisiti kwa miezi mfungate, <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />Wafilisiti wawetangaga walavant'hambiko na wagangana niyo wawauza, “Nekitende vivihi ne Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Zumbe? Nekidivuze vivihi aho dyandile?”<verse eid="1SA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Woho niyo wahitula, “Uneva nomdivuze Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Mnungu ywa Izilaeli, mwaungwa mdivuze na malavo kwakwe, malavo ya masa yenyu. Disanduku dye Ndagano hadikuungwa kuuya haheina malavo kwa sila ino nomnde mhona naho nommanye nii nakawasulumizani.”<verse eid="1SA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Wafilisiti niyo wauza “Ni malavo yani ya masa kikuungigwa kimwigaile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 6:4">Niyo wahitula, “Vihili vishano va zahabu vikale enga maihu na vihili vishano va zahabu vikale enga ngoso kila kimwenga kikamkimaila mkulu yumwenga ywa Wafilisiti kwaviya maihu yatumigwe kwenyu, nayatumigwa na kwa wakulu wenyu. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Mwaungwa mdamanye vihili vekale enga maihu na vihili vikale enga ngoso, vint'hu ivo nevikabananga isi yenyu pele, naho mmogohe Mnungu ywa Izilaeli. Mafani naaleke kuwasulumizani nyuwe ne milungu yenyu ne isi yenyu. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Nii mnde wank'hani? Enga Falao seuta ywa Misili na Wamisili ivo wandaga? Kumbukileni ivo Mnungu ambwalasaga mpaka aho Falao awalekelaga Wazilaeli wahalawe Misili. <verse eid="1SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />Elo ikileni lumwe gali hya na ngombe mbili zeleke hezinati zivalwe kifungo, zifungeni izo mwe digali dikuvutwa ni zing'ombe niyo mwazivuza zindama zawe kwe didewa. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Guheni Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Zumbe niyo mwadigela mwe digali idyo, mnk'handa mwe Disanduku dye Ndagano ikeni viya vihili va zahabu mkumwigaila enga malavo ya kuusa masa yenyu, akajika dilekeni dikeitile. <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />Dikauliseni, uneva dyaita dikahinga kwo mzi wa Beshi Shemesi, ivo neinde kugamba ni Mnungu ywa Izilaeli akigaile makunt'ho aya yaihile. Mna uneva heditende ivo nekimanye kugamba hiyo yehe akigaile makunt'ho aya yaihile.”<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Nawatenda enga ivo wagambilwe, niyo waguha zingombe izo zimbili na kuzifunga mwe digali na kuvugaila zindama kwe didewa. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Nawagela Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Zumbe mwe digali hamwenga ne Ntangulu ine vihili va zahabu vikale enga ngoso na vikale enga maihu. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Ngombe ziya zakongaga kugenda mwe sila kuhinga Beti Shemesi, zagendaga haheina kuhituka kulume hegu kumoso uku zikaila sila yose. Wakulu washano wa Wafilisiti wazitimilaga uko mpaka kwe mihaka ya Beti Shemesi.<verse eid="1SA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Want'hu wa Beti Shemesi wandaga wakavuna ngano mwe dikolongo, weze wakaule kudya waonaga Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Zumbe Mnugu niyo wanda na kinyemi kikulu. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Digali dyezaga kwo mgunda wa mnt'hu etangwagwa Yoshua uyo ekalaga Beti shemesi niyo dyakimala hadya hagihi no luwe lukulu, want'hu niyo wadibogozola diya digali na kuzichinja ziya zing'ombe na kuzoka enga malavo ya kokwa kwa Zumbe Mnugu. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Umwo dikanda dikei kubogozolwa Walawi, wadiselezaga Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Zumbe Mnungu ne nt'hangulu ine vihili via ve zahabu mndani, niyo waviika ho luwe lukulu. Want'hu wa Beti Shemesi walavaga malavo ya kokwa na malavo matuhu kwa Zumbe. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Wadya maseuta washano wa Wafilisiti wawaonaga wakadamanya ivo, weze wayaone ayo wauyaga uko Ekuloni mwe dizuwa iidyo.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Wafilisiti wegalaga vihili vishano va maihu kwa Zumbe enga malavo kwaajili ya masa yawe kamwenga kwaajili yo mzi wa Ashidodi, na katuhu kwaajili ya mzi wa Gaza na kamwenga kwaajili ya mzi wa Ashikeloni na katuhu kwaajili ya mzi wa Gati na katuhu kwaajili ya mzi wa Ekuloni. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />Naho, wegalaga vihili va zahabu vikale enga ngoso, kamwenga kwa kila mzi wikailwe ni maseuta washano wa Wafilisiti, mizi yose izengelwe nk'handula ne zikaya hezizengelwe nk'handula. Diya diiwe dikulu mwo mgunda wa Yoshua uyo ekekalaga Beti Shemesi uko dyaikagwa Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Zumbe Mnungu, dikei aaho mpaka ivi dyelo kunda uwona kwa kiya chalailaga.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />Zumbe Mnungu awakomaga want'hu milongo mfungate wo mzi wa Beti Shemesi kwaviya wasungilaga mndani mwe Disanduku dye Ndagano, want'hu wahongezaga kiya Zumbe atendaga.<verse eid="1SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Disanduku dya Ndagano dya Zumbe uko Kiliati Yealimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Ivo want'hu wa Beti Shemesi niyo wauza, “Niani akudaha kukimala ho undiilo wa Zumbe Mnungu, uyu Zumbe Mnungu akukile? Haluse nekigalehi disanduku idi vileke dinde hale na suwe?” <verse eid="1SA 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Wegalaga wegala ulosi kwa want'hu wa Kiliati Yelimu, wakagamba, “Wafilisiti wadivuza Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Zumbe Mnungu, soni uku mdiguhe.”<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Want'hu wa Kiliyati Yelimu wezaga niyo wadiguha Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Zumbe, na kudigala kwe nyumba ya Abinadabu uko kwe kagulu, niyo wamwiika Eliyazali uyo mwanawe ywe kilume ande mwamizi ywe Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samweli ailongoza Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Sanduku dye Ndagano dya Zumbe Mnungu dyekalaga Kiliyati Yelimu kwa lupisi lutali, yabulaga miyaka milongo miidi. Mwo lupisi ulu lwose Waizilaeli wamwiilaga Zumbe Mnungu kwa wambizi.<verse eid="1SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Samweli niyo awagamba want'hu wose wa Izilaeli, “Uneva mwamhitukila Zumbe Mnungu kwa miyoyo yenyu yose, mwaungwa kuileka milungu yose ya watakwiza na kuusa mahili ya Ashitaloti, mtimileni Zumbe Mnungu kwa moyo wose na kunda wandima wakwe yehe ekedu, yehe naye naawayokoleni kulawa mwo udahi wa Wafilisiti.” <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Ivo Waizilaeli wausaga mahili ya milungu ya Baali na Mashitaloti, niyo wamvika Zumbe Mnungu uuyo du.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Niyo Samweli agamba, “Waduganyeni Waizilaeli wose uko Mizipa, miye neni mlombeze Zumbe Mnungu kwaajili yenyu.” <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Ivo Waizilaeli waduganaga uko Mizipa, watekaga mazi niyo wayetila ha Zumbe kunda malavo. Wafungaga mwe dizuwa diya dyose, niyo wagamba, “Kidamanya wavu kwa Zumbe.” Yandaga ni uko Mizipa Samweli andaga mlamuzi mwa Waizilaeli.<verse eid="1SA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Umwo Wafilisiti weze weve Waizilaeli wakeduganya uko Mizipa, wakulu washano wa Wafilisiti waitaga wakatowane na Waizilaeli, Waizilaeli weze weve mbuli iyo wogohesaga. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Niyo wamgamba Samweli, “Gendeela kukilombezela kwa Zumbe akiyokole kulawa kwa Wafilisiti.” <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Niho Samweli aguhaga mwana ngoto niyo ayoka yose kunda nt'hambiko kwa Zumbe, niyo alombeza kwa Zumbe awaambize Waizilaeli, Zumbe naye niyo ahitula. <verse eid="1SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Umwo Samweli andaga akalava int'hambiko Wafilisiti wasogelaga vileke wawatowe Izilaeli. Mna mwe dizua diya Zumbe Mnungu niyo alonga kwa izwi dya mtint'hilo kwa Wafilisiti, niyo awazaganya Wafilisiti, Wafilisiti wawanyilikaga Waizilaeli.<verse eid="1SA 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Waizilaeli walawaga Mizipa na kuwagulusa Wafilisiti mpaka hagihi no mzi wa Betikali, na kuwakoma uko.<verse eid="1SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Samweli niyo aguha iwe, adiikaga hagati yo mizi ya Sheni na Mizipa, niyo agamba, “Zumbe kachambiza suwe hata ivi. Niyo adink'ha zina nidyo Ebeneza, nuko kugamba, mpaka ivi haluse Zumbe Mnungu kachambiza.” <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Ivo Wafilisiti watowagwa, Zumbe Mnungu naye awakindilaga wase kuikump'hukila Izilaeli mwo lupisi lwose aho Samweli andaga mgima. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Mizi yose yatahagwa ni Wafilisiti hagati ya Ekuloni na Gati yawavuzagwa kwa Izilaeli, naivo Waizilaeli waikombolaga isi yawe yose, naho kwandaga na utondowazi mwa Waizilaeli na Wakanaani.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Kukongela aho, Samweli agendeelaga kunda kilongozi ywa Izilaeli mwo wikazi wakwe wose. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Kila mwaka naakazungulukila Beseli na Giligali na Mizipa na mwose umwo andaga akawalamula Waizilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Mna naho andaga akauya Lama kwaviya nuko kwandaga ikaya yakwe,naho uko Lama nako andaga akawalamula Waizilaeli, naho uko nako azengaga kilingo cha Zumbe.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli walombeza wande na seuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Samweli eze adalahale awatendaga wanawe kunda vilongozi mwe Izilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Mwanawe mkulu ywe kilume etangwagwa Yoeli na mdodo naye andaga Abia awo wandaga vilongozi uko Beli Sheba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Mna hawatimilaga mliganyizo wa tati yawe, waungisaga du kukepatila upati, ivo wazumilaga kuhokela matundu ya soni, na kwaza uwagilwa.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Ivo, wadala vilongozi wose wa Izilaeli wakeduganyaga, niyo waita uko Lama kwa Samweli, <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />niyo wamgamba, “Kaula haluse wadalahala naho wanawo hawakutimila mliganyizo wako, ivo elo sagula seuta naakilongoze vileke kinde na seuta enga ivo zili isi nt'huhu.” <verse eid="1SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Samweli helelwagwa wakagamba kisaguile seuta, ivo Samweli amlombezaga Zumbe, <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Zumbe naye niyo agamba, “Tegeleza kila kint'hu want'hu icho wakulonga kwako, kwaviya hawakulemele weye, mna wanilemela miye nisekunda seuta ywawe. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Kukongela aho nawalavaga mwe isi ya Misili woho wanileka miye na kuvika milungu mituhu mpaka haluse, naho wadamanya kwako ikiya wadamanyanga kwangu. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Naivo wategeleze, naho uwakanyise, na kuwagambila pwilili wamanye viya nevungwe kulawa kwawe ni seuta,”<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Samweli awagambilaga want'hu awo nawakalombeza kunda na seuta, na kila kint'hu kiya Zumbe Mnungu amgambile. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Ivi nivo seuta ywenyu naawatendeleni, “Naawaguhe wana wenyu wa kilume niyo awatenda wakugendeza magali na wakugendeza falasi, watuhu nawaguluke kulongole kwa magali yakwe kwaajili ya kumwamila. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Wamwenga naawatende vilongozi wa want'hu alufu, wamwenga nawande vilongozi wa want'hu milongo mishano. Wana wenyu nawande walimi we migunda yakwe wakavuna ulozo wakwe na kudamanya vitoanilo va nk'hondo na visonganyilo va magali yakwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Wana wenyu we kike naawaguhe wadamanye mavuta ya mhemp'he watuhu nawo naawatende wambisi na woka mikate yakwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />Naaguhe migunda yenyu iyedi ya nk'hande, ne migunda iyedi ye mizabibu na iyedi ye mizeituni na kuwenk'ha wandima wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Naaguhe imwenga ya mlongo ye nk'hande yenyu na zabibu zenyu niyo awenk'ha vilongozi we hasi yakwe na wandima wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Naaguhe wandima wenyu na ng'ombe zenyu zigimbale na mp'hunda zenyu na kuzitenda zidamanye ndima kwaajili yakwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Naaguhe imwenga ya mlongo ye mifugwa yenyu, nyuwe wenye nanywe nomnde watumwa wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Lupisi ulo lukeza mpaka, nyuwe nomlabile kwa usungu kwajili ya masulumizo nompate kulawa kwa uyo seuta mkesaguile wenye, mna Zumbe Mnungu haategeleze kulabila kwenyu.”<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Mna want'hu hawaungile kumtegeleza Samweli, niyo wagamba, “Bule! Chaunga seuta ywetu, <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />vileke kinde enga want'hu wa si nt'huhu, kinde na seuta ywetu suwe wenye akuunga akilongoze umwo kikatowana nk'hondo yetu.”<verse eid="1SA 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Samweli ategelezaga kila kint'hu walongile niyo agenda kumgambila Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo amhitula Samweli, “Damanya kiya wakuunga naho wasaguile seuta. Samweli niyo awagamba want'hu wose waite kwe zikaya zawe.”<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Sauli adugana na Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Kwandaga na mnt'hu mgoli naho amanyikise zina dyakwe etangwagwa Kishi ywe dikabila dya Benjamini. Andaga mwana Abieli naho mwezukuluwe dya Zela ywe mp'huga ya Bekolati ywo lukolo lwa Afia. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Andaga na mwana kilume etangwagwa Sauli. Sauli andaga mbwanga naho hakwandaga na mnt'hu aliganaga na Sauli kwa ubwanga mwe Izilaeli, Sauli andaga mtali kujink'ha mnt'hu yeyose, want'hu wose mwo utali wawe waheelaga mwa maega yakwe.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Zuwa dimwenga mp'hunda za Kishi ise dya Sauli zagaga, ivo Kishi amgambaga Sauli, “Guha mndima yumwenga mwitanye mkazizungule.” <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Wagendaga kuzizungula kwe isi ye vigulu ya uko Ifulaimu na uko Shalisha, mna hawazionaga uko. Niyo wabula Shalimu uko nako hawazione, naho wazizungulaga mwe isi ya Benjamini uko nako hawazione. <verse eid="1SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Weze wabule kwe isi ya Sufu, Sauli amgambaga mndima ywakwe, “Kiuye kaya, chaivo tate naaleke kufanyanya zimp'hunda, niyo anda na kiyangayanga kwaajili yetu.”<verse eid="1SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Niyo yudya mndima ahitula, “Mwo mzi uno kuna mnt'hu ywa Mnungu naho akuzumiliswa kwaviya kila kint'hu akulonga chanda kindedi. Goja kiite kwakwe naakadaha kukigambila kigende sila yani.”<verse eid="1SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Sauli niyo auza “Uneva kinaita kwakwe nekimwink'hei? Hakina nk'hande isigale mwe mifuko yetu naho hakina kint'hu cha kumwink'ha?”<verse eid="1SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Yudya mndima niyo ahitula “Miye nna kasawa kadodo nadaha kumwink'ha aako na ivo naakigambile uko nekizione.”<verse eid="1SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />Aho nk'hongo mwe Izilaeli uneva mnt'hu akaunga amlombeze Mnungu mbuli agamba ivi, Haya kiite kwo muwoni kwaviya mnt'hu akwitangwa mlotezi mwa mazuwa ayo etangwagwa muwona.<verse eid="1SA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Sauli niyo ahitula “Ivo kufanyanya vedi haya kite.” Ivo niyo waita kudya kwo mzi wa uyo mnt'hu ywa Mnungu.<verse eid="1SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Umwo wandile wakakwela kwa kalima kwo mzi uwo waduganaga na wandele wandaga wakeza kuteka mazi, “Niyo wawauza wadya wandele togolani yudya muwoni eyuko uko kwo mzi?” <verse eid="1SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Niyo wahitula, “Heiye eyuko, naho ekulongole kwenyu. Mnakombeka nomumbwiile. Keza kwo mzi dyelo kwaviya want'hu walava nt'hambiko uko kwe kagulu. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Aho mkeza kwingila mwo mzi nomumbwiile hanati aite hant'hu ha kulavila nt'hambiko vileke akadye. Kwaviya want'hu hawadyaga ink'hande mpaka yehe aivikile nt'hambiko iyo. Akajika wadya walalikwe niho nawadye, ivo kombekeni kuita, nombwiilane naye.”<verse eid="1SA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Ivo Sauli no mndima ywakwe wagendeelaga kuita kwo mzi. Naho umwo wakengila mwo mzi wamuonaga Samweli akeza kuhinga kwawe umwo andile akaita hant'hu ha kuvikila.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Zuwa dimwenga umwo Sauli andaga hanati kuita kwa Samweli Zumbe Mnungu amlagisga Samweli imbuli ino akamgamba, <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />“Luvi mwo lupisi enga ulu, nohwigaile mnt'hu ywe dikabila dya Benjamini, umtende ande kilongozi ywa want'hu wangu Izilaeli, yehe naawakombole kulawa kwa Wafilisiti. Hiona masulumizo ya want'hu wangu naho hiiva indilo yawe ya kuunga wambizi kwangu.”<verse eid="1SA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Samweli eze amuone Sauli, Zumbe Mnungu niyo amgamba, “Uyu niye mnt'hu nakugambile. Naawalongoze want'hu wangu.” <verse eid="1SA 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Niyo Sauli aitaga kwa Samweli hagihi ne nk'hili, niyo amgamba, “Nakulombeza unilagise nyumba yo muwona?”<verse eid="1SA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Samweli niyo ahitulai, “Muwoni ni miye. Haya longoleni hant'hu ha kulanga, nyuwe nyose nomnde hamwenga na miye dyelo, luvi mtondo neniwagambileni zimbuli zenyu zose mnanazo, na kuwalekelani mwite. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Na kwe mbuli ye zimp'hunda zagile mwe mazuwa matatu yomboke, usekogoha, zioneka kale. Mna niani uyo akuungiswa ni want'hu wa izilaeli? Togola hiyo weye hamwenga ne mp'huga ya iso?”<verse eid="1SA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Sauli niyo ahitula, “Miye ni ywe dikabila dya Benjamini kabila ditendesa udodo mwe Izilaeli, naho mp'huga yangu niyo itendese udodo mwe dikabaila dya Benjamini, mna nii walonga mbuli enga izi kwangu?”<verse eid="1SA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Niyo Samweli awegala Sauli na mndima wakwe kwe chumba kikulu, niyo awaika hant'hu aho wekale wakulu wose walalikwe. Want'hu awo wose wandaga milongo mitatu. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Samweli niyo amgamba mwambisi, “Guha kihendo cha nyama kiya nakugambile ukiike hank'handa.” <verse eid="1SA 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Ivo mwambisi aguhaga kihendo kiya ne kiga niyo akileta kwa Sauli. Samweli niyo agamba, kihendo iki ni kiya wagambile hwikile dya, kwaviya nokuikilwa weye vileke udye hamwenga na wose walalikwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 9:24">Ivo mwe dizuwa idyo Sauli adyaga hamwenga na Samweli,<verse eid="1SA 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Weze waseele kulawa hant'hu ha ho mviko mpaka kwo mzi, Samweli amguhaga Sauli niyo waitanya kwe chumba cha kulanga kwe nyumba niyo aika lumwe ugono kwajili ya Sauli.<verse eid="1SA 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samweli amtenda Sauli kunda seuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Niyo agona aaho. Wenukaga mtotondo Samweli niyo amgamba Sauli uko kwe digulu, “Funganya, hulage.” Sauli eze ajike kufunganya, wafosaga kuse hamwenga na Samweli. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Umwo wandaga wakaseela kunk'handa yo mzi, Samweli amgambaga Sauli, “Mgambe mndima uyo alongole. Weye goja ludodo vileke hwink'he ulosi kulawa kwa Mnungu.”<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Niyo Samweli aguha kasupa kadodo ka mavuta ya zeituni niyo ayagida mwo mtwi wa Sauli niyo amnonela akagamba, “Zumbe Mnungu kakutenda unde seuta ywa Izilaeli. Nou walongoze want'hu wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Dyelo ukahalawa noubwilane na want'hu waidi hagihi ne kikuta cha Laheli uko Selisa mwe mihaka ye isi ya Benjamini. Nawakugambile kugamba zimp'hunda ziya noukazungula zioneka, iso hakugendeela kogohesa mwe zimbuli ze zimp'hunda izo mna akeuza, ‘Nenitende vivihi mwe mbuli ya mwanangu?’ <verse eid="1SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />Kulawa aho nowiite mpaka kwo mti ukukile uko Taboli. Uko nouwabwiile want'hu watatu mwe sila wakugenda kumlavila nt'hambiko Mnungu uko Beseli. Yumwenga naande asaka mabehela matatu, yumwenga naye naande kenula mikate mitatu, yumwenga naye naande kenula bete dye divai. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />Nawakulamse niyo wakwink'ha mikate miidi nawe noiihokele. <verse eid="1SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />Akajika nowiite kwa kagulu uko Gibea ya Mnungu, uko kune nk'hambi ya Wafilisiti. Aho ho mwingilo wo mzi noudugane na fyo dya walotezi wakaseela kulawa kwe kilingo uko kwo kulavila malavo wakatowa ving'weng'we na vigoma na miluli na mazeze nawande walotela. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Aaho Muye ywa Zumbe Mnungu naakwizile mwako kwa udahi, weye nawe noukonge kulotela na kuhituka kunda mnt'hu mtuhu. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Umwo aya yose yakalaila damanya chochose kiya Mnungu naakulongoze kudamanya. <verse eid="1SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />Nounilongoele kuita Giligali uko noubwiile hant'hu ha kulavila nt'hambiko ya kokwa na nt'hambiko ya utondowazi. Unigoje hadya kwa mazuwa mfungate mpaka nize hugambile cho kudamanya.”<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Sauli eze ahituke na kwasana na Samweli, Mnungu azihitulaga moyo wa Sauli. Naho kila kint'hu kiya Samweli amgambile nekilaila mwe dizuwa diya. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Umwo Sauli na mndima ywakwe weze wabule Gibea fyo dya walotezi nedimsingila. Aaho muye ywa Mnungu yamwizilaga, niyo akelunga nawo mwo kulotela. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Want'hu wammanyaga aho nk'hongo weze wamuone akadamanya ivo, wakeuzaga wakagamba, “Mbuli yani ino ikulaila aha kwa mwana ywa Kishi dyelo, Sauli kanda mlotezi? ” <verse eid="1SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />Mnt'hu yumwenga ywa aaho auzaga, watati zawe ni wahi? Ivi nivo nawakalonga wakagamba, “Hata Sauli kanda mlotezi?” <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Sauli eze ibinde kulotela aitaga naho hant'hu ha kulavila nt'hambiko.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Esemdodo dya Sauli eze awaone Sauli na mndima ywakwe awauzaga “Nomnda hii?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:14">Sauli niyo ahitula, “Nekikazizungula zimp'hunda, kize kinde hakizione nekiita kwa Samweli.”<verse eid="1SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Ise mdodo dya Sauli amgambaga, “Haya longa kiya akugambile Samweli.”<verse eid="1SA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Sauli niyo ahitula, “Nakakigamba zimp'hunda zioneka.” Mna hamgambile ise mdodo kiya alongile Samweli mwe mbuli ya yehe kunda seuta.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli anda seuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Niyo Samweli awaduganyaga Waizilaeli ha Zumbe Mnungu uko Mizipa. <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />Niyo awagamba, “Zumbe Mnungu ywa Izilaeli agamba, ‘Nawalavagani nyuwe kulawa Misili na kuwayokolani kulawa kwa Wamisili naho isi zose nezikawatendelani vihile. <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Ni miye Mnungu ywenyu uyo awayokoleni kulawa mwe makunt'ho na masulumizo yenyu, mna dyelo mnilemela, naho mnilombeza niwenk'heni seuta. Ni vedi, keduganyeni nyuwe wenye ha Zumbe Mnungu mkanda mwe makabila yenyu ne zink'holo zenyu.’”<verse eid="1SA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Umwo Samweli ayaletaga makabila ya Izilaeli hagihi, kabila dya Benjamini dyasagulagwa kwa kutoa kula. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Niyo adigala kulongole dikabila dya Benjamini lukolo kwa lukolo, lukolo lwa Matili niyo lwasagulwa, niyo asagulwa Sauli mwana Kishi. Mna umwo weze wamzungule nakanda haoneke. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Ivo wamuuza naho Zumbe Mnungu, “Togola mnt'hu uyu keza kale aha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:22">Zumbe niyo ahitula, “Heiye kakefisa mwe zint'hanu.”<verse eid="1SA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Ivo wasunguzaga kuguluka niyo wampata na kumleta Sauli kwa want'hu, niyo waona kugamba andaga mnt'hu mtali kujink'ha mnt'hu yeyose. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Samweli niyo awagamba want'hu, “Uyu ni mnt'hu asagulwe ni Zumbe Mnungu, hahana mtuhu yeyose mwa suwe enga yehe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:24">Want'hu wose niyo wanga wakagamba, “Seuta wikalise mazuwa yose!”<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Samweli awatambalisaga want'hu uwagilwa no undima wa seuta, niyo auwandika mwe kitabu icho chaikagwa ha Zumbe Mnungu aho niho awalagaga, kila yumwenga auye kwe kaya yakwe. <verse eid="1SA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Sauli naye auyaga kwe kaya uko Gibea, fyo dya want'hu dyaitaga na Sauli kwaviya ni Mnungu awatendaga waite hamwenga naye. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Mna want'hu wata lubezo niyo wagamba, “Mnt'hu uyu hakudaha kukiyokola kulawa kwa wank'hondo wetu, wambelaga Sauli naho hawamwink'hile mageleko yeyose. Mna Sauli halongile dyodyose.?”<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Sauli awahuma Waamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Mwezi umwenga wize womboke, Seuta Nahashi ywa Amoni awalongozaga watowani wakwe wakautowe mzi wa Yabeshi mwe isi ya Gileadi na kuutaha, want'hu wa Yabeshi wamgambaga Nahashi, “Damanya mwivano na suwe nekikuzumile kunda seuta ywetu.”<verse eid="1SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Nahashi niyo ahitula, “Nekidamanye mwivano kwa mbuli imwenga, nenimng'ole kila yumwenga ywenyu ziso dya kulume, naivo neniwagele soni Waizilaeli wose mwe ziisi zint'huhu.”<verse eid="1SA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Vilongozi wa Yabeshi niyo wamgamba, “Kink'he mazuwa mfungate kitume wegala ulosi mwe isi yose ya Izilaeli, uneva hakuna yeyose naakiyokole, nekikehonye kwako.”<verse eid="1SA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Wadya wegala ulosi weze wabule Gibea niyo walonga imbuli iyo kwa want'hu, wose wailaga kwa izwi kulu. <verse eid="1SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Aaho Sauli niyo eza akalawa kwo mgunda akanda ne zing'ombe zakwe, niyo auza, “Kuna kibwani kikuwatenda want'hu waile?” Niyo wamgambila kiya walongile wegala ulosi kulawa Yabeshi. <verse eid="1SA 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Sauli eze eve ivo Muye ywa Mnungu amwiziilaga, niyo anda na maya, <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />niyo aguha majeku maidi na kukant'hakant'ha, awatumaga wegala ulosi wegale vihendo ivo mwe isi yose ya Izilaeli wakagamba, “Uneva mnt'hu yeyose hanaitile kwe nk'hondo na Sauli na Samweli njeku zakwe nezisengwesengwe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 11:7">Zumbe niyo awatenda want'hu wose wa Izilaeli wogohe kwa kiya Sauli naakaunga awatendele na wose wahalawaga kwa hamwenga.<verse eid="1SA 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Sauli niyo aduganya wose uko Bezeki, wandaga ni want'hu magana matatu alufu kulawa Izilaeli na alufu milongo mitatu kulawa Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Niyo wawagamba kulawa Yabeshi, “Wagambile want'hu wa Yabeshi Giliedi kugamba luvi nomsi nomnde wayokolwa.” Umwo want'hu wa Yabeshi weze weve ulosi uwo wandaga na kinyemi, <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />niyo want'hu wa Yabeshi wawabela wank'hondo wawe awo want'hu wa seuta Nahashi wakawagamba, “Luvi nekikehonye kwenyu, naho mwadaha kukitendela chochose kiya mkuunga.”<verse eid="1SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Kilokilo zuwa ditimile, Sauli awapangaga want'hu wakwe mwe vifyo vitatu, waikunp'hukilaga ink'hambi ya wank'hondo awo Waamoni niyo wawatowa. Kubula nomsi Waamoni nawanda wachinjigwa. Wadya wasigale wasambalaga kila yumwenga akegulukilaga mwenye.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Want'hu wa Izilaeli niyo wamgamba Samweli, “Wekuhi wadya want'hu wagambile Sauli hakudaha kunda seuta ywetu, wenk'hizwe kwetu vileke suwe kiwakome.”<verse eid="1SA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Mna Sauli niyo agamba, “Hahali yeyose naakomwe dyelo kwaviya zuwa idi dya dyelo Zumbe Mnungu kaiyokola Izilaeli.”<verse eid="1SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Samweli niyo awagamba, “Nekiteni chose uko Giligali kikazumilane uhya kugamba Sauli agendeele kunda seuta ywetu” <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Ivo wose waitaga Giligali, niyo aho ha Zumbe wamzumilaga Sauli kunda seuta. Walavaga malavo yawe ya utondowazi, niyo Sauli na want'hu wose wa Izilaeli wanda na kinyemi kikulu.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Samweli awatambalisa want'hu wa Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Niyo Samweli awagamba want'hu wa Izilaeli, “Hiyategeleza yose mnigambile, naho hiwenk'hani seuta awalongozeni. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Haluse mpata seuta kilongozi ywenyu, miye hidalahala naho nna fi na wanangu wa kilume we hamwenga na nyuwe. Nehinda kilongozi ywenyu kukongela ubwanga wangu mpaka ivi dielo. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />Hikimala aha, uneva hidamanya kint'hu chochose kiihile longeni aha ha Zumbe Mnungu na seuta amsagule. Togoleni higuha ngo'mbe ya mnt'hu hegu ph'unda yakwe nehimtowa mnt'hu hegu kumgela soni yeyose? Hihokela kint'hu chochose cha soni kulawa kwa mnt'hu yoyose? Uneva hidamanya kint'hu chochose mwa aya nitambule nenilihe icho niguhile.”<verse eid="1SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Want'hu niyo wahitula, “Bule, hukitendele vihile naho hukihujile naho hunati uhokele matundu ya soni kwa mnt'hu yeyose.”<verse eid="1SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Samweli niyo ahitula, “Zumbe Mnungu na seuta asagulwe ni Zumbe, ni waona wangu dielo kugamba mniona kindedi miye hina masa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 12:5">Want'hu niyo wahitula, “Heiye muwona ywetu ni Zumbe.”<verse eid="1SA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />Samweli agendeelaga, “Zumbe Mnungu niye awasagulaga Musa na Haluni, naho niye awalavaga wakale ywenyu kulawa mwe isi ya Misili. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Haluse kimaleni aho na miye neniwalagise kwa uwona hawakumbusani udamanyi mkulu wa Zumbe Mnungu uwo awadamanyileni nyuwe vileke awayokoleni nyuwe na wakale wenyu. <verse eid="1SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />Umwo Yakobo na mp'huga yakwe weze waite Misili niyo Wamisili wawatendela mbuli ziihile wakale wenyu, wamwiihiyaga Zumbe kwa wambizi niyo yehe amtuma Musa na Haluni uyo awalavaga woho kulawa Misili niyo awatenda nyuwe mnde aha dielo. <verse eid="1SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />Mna want'hu nawamjala Zumbe Mnungu ywawe na ivo nakawatenda Wafilisiti na seuta ywa Moabu na Sisela mkulu ywa watowani wo mzi wa Hazoli watowane na wakale wenyu niyo wawahuma. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Niyo wamwiila Zumbe Mnungu kwa wambizi wakagamba, ‘Kitenda wavu kwaviya kihituka niyo chakuleka weye Zumbe, niyo chaivika mahili ya Baali na Maashitaloti. Mna haluse nekikuvike weye wikedu, kiyokola kulawa kwa wank'hondo wetu.’ <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Zumbe Mnungu naye awatumaga Gidioni, Balaki, Yefita na Samweli wawayokoleni nyuwe kulawa kwa wank'hondo wenyu awo wawazungulukagani, niyo mwekala kwa utondowazi. <verse eid="1SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />Mna kwaviya nomkamwogoha seuta Nehashi ywa Waamoni, niyo mwanigamba, ‘Chaunga seuta akilongoze.’ Hata uneva Zumbe Mnungu ywenyu nakanda niye seuta ywenyu.<verse eid="1SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />“Haluse seuta muungile ni uyo aha, Mwamlombezaga Zumbe Mnungu awenk'heni seuta, naye niyo awenk'ha. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Mbuli zose nezigende vedi mwenyu uneva nomumvike na kumwiva na kutimila zisigilizi zakwe, naho uneva nyuwe na seuta ywenyu nomumtimile. <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Mna hamtegeleze zisigilizi za Zumbe Mnungu niyo mwasaguka kwe zisigilizi zakwe, yehe naye naahigane na nyuwe hamwenga na seuta ywenyu. <verse eid="1SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />Ivo elo kimaleni aaho mwili nanywe nomuone mbuli nk'hulu izo Zumbe Mnungu akuunga adamanye. <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Togoleni haluse hi lupisi lwa uvuni wa ngano naho wandaga ni msimo wa kiangazi? Mna neni mlombeze Zumbe Mnungu egala lumwemwe na fula. Nanywe nommanye kugamba mwadamanyisaga uwihi wiihise ha Zumbe umwo mwamlombezaga awenk'heni seuta.”<verse eid="1SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Ivo Samweli amlombezaga Zumbe Mnungu, Zumbe naye niyo aleta lumwemwe na fula mwe dizuwa idyo. Want'hu wose niyo wamwogohesa Zumbe na Samweli, niyo wagamba mkulu kilombezele kwa Zumbe Mnungu ywako vileke kisekubanika. <verse eid="1SA 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Niyo want'hu wose wamgamba Samweli, “Kilombezele kwa Zumbe Mnungu ywako vileke kise kubanika, kwaviya chongezela wiihi uno mwo wavu wetu wose kwa kukeungila seuta.”<verse eid="1SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Samweli niyo ahitula, “Msekogoha hata uneva mdamanya wiihi uno msekuhituka mkamleka Zumbe Mnungu mna mvikeni yehe kwa mioyo yenyu yose. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Msekuitimila milungu yo udant'hi heiikudaha kuwambizani hegu kuwayokolani kwaviya hiyo ya kindedi. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />Zumbe Mnungu kaika Ndagano ye kindedi naho haawalekeni nyuwe kwaviya kalamula kuwatendani nyuwe kunda want'hu wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />Mna kwa miye henileke kuwalombezela kwa Zumbe Mnungu. Mnatenda ivo neinde hitenda vihile kwa Zumbe, nenigendeele kuwahiniza sila zedi na za uwagilwa. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu na kumvika kwa uhuhilwa kwa mioyo yenyu yose. Kumbukileni vint'hu vikulu amidamanyileni. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Mna mnagendeela kutenda wavu nyuwe hamwenga na seuta ywenyu nombanangwe pele.”<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Malavo ya Sauli heyezumilwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Sauli andaga na miaka milongo mitatu umwo akanda seuta ailongozaga Izilaeli kwa miyaka milongo mine na miidi. <verse eid="1SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Sauli asagulaga want'hu alufu nt'hatu. Mwa awo alufu mbili andaga nawo uko Mikimashi na mwe isi ye vigulu va Beseli alufu imwenga awaikaga uko Gibea mwe isi ya Benjamini awo wandaga wakalongozwa na mwanaye Yonasani. Wagosi wasigalaga awavuzaga kwe zikaya zawe.<verse eid="1SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Yonasani na want'hu wakwe wawatoaga watowani wa Wafilisiti mwe nk'hambi uko Gibea niyo Wafilisiti weva mbuli iyo, ivo Sauli atowaga gunda mwe isi yose akagamba, “Waebulania na weve!” <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Waizilaeli wose wevaga kugamba Sauli kaitaha ink'hambi ya watowani wa Wafilisiti naho kugamba Wafilisiti wawaihiya Waizilaeli. Ivo Waizilaeli wose wetangagwa wande hamwenga na Sauli uko Giligali.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Wafilisiti wandaga na magali ya nk'hondo alufu milongo mitatu na watowani alufu mtandatu wakugendeza magali ya nk'hondo, na watowani wakugenda lwa viga wabindile wengi, wose wakwelaga na kuika nk'hambi uko Mikimashi ulailo wa zuwa wa Beti Aveni. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Wafilisiti wawakup'hukilaga Waizilaeli kwa udahi mkulu watowani awo wa Izilaeli waonaga kugamba wekailwa vihile. Ivo wengi wekefisaga kwe zip'hanga na mwe visaka na mwe mabome ye hasi na mwe zinyuwe wamwenga na masima heyena mazi, <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />wamwenga wadendelukaga mto Yolodani mpaka kwe isi ya Gadi na Gileadi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:7">Sauli andaga akei uko Giligali, na wadya want'hu wose wamtimilaga wakazingiza kwa wogohi.<verse eid="1SA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Sauli agojelaga kwa mazuwa mfungate enga ivo Samweli asigiilaga atende, mna Samweli andaga akei kwiza Giligali, wadya want'hu nawo wendaga na Sauli wakongaga kumnyilika. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Sauli niyo agamba, “Nigaileni malavo yo kokwa na malavo yo utondowazi.” Naye niyo alava malavo yo kokwa. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Aho eze ibinde kulava malavo yo kokwa ayo Samweli abulaga, Sauli naye agendaga kumsingila na kumhokela.<verse eid="1SA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Samweli niyo auza, “Kudamanyai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:11">Sauli niyo ahitula, “Nize nione kugamba want'hu wanyilika weye nawe nokunda hwizile mwo lupisi ulo ulongile, naho Wafilisiti nawo wakeduganya uko Mikimashi, <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />naho nehiona kugamba, Haluse ‘Wafilisiti nawaseele wanitowe aha Giligali name nehinda hinati nilombeze wambizi wa Zumbe Mnungu.’ Ivo nehifanyanya kulava malavo yo koka miye mwenye.”<verse eid="1SA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Samweli niyo ahitula, “Hudamanye viligane ne zisigilizi za Zumbe Mnungu ywako.” “Wandile watimile, useuta mwa Izilaeli hegu noutoga kale kwa lupisi lwose. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Mna haluse useuta wako hogendeele. Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu kazungula mnt'hu mtuhu akumwelela umoyo wakwe, kamsagula kilongozi ywa want'hu wakwe kwaviya weye hutimile viya akugambile udamanye.”<verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Samweli ahalawaga kulawa Giligali na kuita Gibea mwe isi ya Benjamini. Sauli awawazaga want'hu andaga hamwenga nawo. Wandaga ni want'hu magana mtandatu du. <verse eid="1SA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Sauli na Yonasani mwanawe na want'hu wawe watowaga nk'hambi uko Gibea mwe isi ya Benjamini, nk'hambi ya Wafilisiti yandaga uko Mikimashi. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Mafyo ya watowani ya Wafilisiti yalawaga kwe nk'hambi yawe niyo yagenda kutowa yakanda mwe mafyo matatu. Fyo dimwenga dikahinga Hofula mwe isi ya Shuali. <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />Fyo tuhu dikahinga Beti Haloni, tuhu nadyo dikahinga kwe mihaka ye dikolongo dya Sebohimu kuhinga kwe dijangwa.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />Hakwandile na msani mwe isi yose ya Izilaeli kwaviya Wafilisiti hawawalekelaga kusana mijungi na sime wakagamba, “Hakinakaulise Waebulania nawadamanye sime na mijungo.” <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Mna Waizilaeli nevikawaunga kuseela kwa Wafilisiti vileke wakanole magembe yakukokotwa ne zing'ombe na mgembe na hoya na sululu yakwe. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Waizilaeli wandaga wakaliha vibesu viidi va masawa kwa kunoela gembe dya kulima na ng'ombe na sululu. Yombe dya kunoela hoya na mjungo yandaga vibesu viidi va masawa. <verse eid="1SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Na ivo mwe dizuwa dya nk'hondo hakwanda na mtowani wa Izilaeli andaga na sime hegu mjungo, mna ni Sauli na mwanawe Yonasani du nawo wandaga navo.<verse eid="1SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Ivo Wafilisiti wegalaga watowani wakamile umwina wa Mikimashi.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Yonasani hogohe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Zuwa dimwenga, Yonasani mwana seuta Sauli, amgambilaga yudya mbwanga nakamwinuila vitoanilo vakwe, “Soo, kite ng'ambo mwe gomela dya Wafilisiti.” Mna Yonasani nakanda hamgambile ise. <verse eid="1SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Sauli nakaika nk'hambi hasi ya mkomamanga uko Migiloni, kuse yo mzi wa Gibea, akanda hamwenga na want'hu wabuile magana mtandatu. <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />Ahiya, mwana ywa Ahitubu ndugu dya Ikabodi mwana ywa Finehasi, naho uyo Ahiya mwizukuluwe dya Eli mlavant'hambiko ywa Mnungu mwo mzi wa Shilo, nakanda kavala kazibao ka mlavant'hambiko. Want'hu hawamanyize kugamba Yonasani nakahalawa kale.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Yonasani aikaga mzungu kugamba, yehe na yudya mbwanga nawaungwa kwombokela ho mwina, ni hagati ye diwawi dyo luwe lutulike, niho abule aho dili idifyo dya watowani wa Wafilisiti. Mwina umwenga ukwitangwa Bosesi, lutuhu nalo lwitangwa Sene. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Mwina umwenga lwandaga mkoma mahanya yo mzi wa Mikimashi, lutuhu nalo lwandaga Kwa mwenye mzi kuhinga mwo mzi wa Gibea.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Yonasani niyo amgamba yudya mbwanga amwinuilaga vitowanilo, “Soo, kiite kwe nt'hendelo ya kaidi kwe nk'hambi ya want'hu hewevinilwe, mafani Zumbe naachambize kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu hakuyokola kwa kuhuwila uwingi wa want'hu hegu ugeke wa want'hu.”<verse eid="1SA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Yudya mbwanga amwiinule vitowanilo niyo amgamba, “Damanya chochose miye ni hamwenga na weye kwa chochose noulamule kudamanya.”<verse eid="1SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Niyo Yonasani amgamba, “Nenidendeluke kiwabase want'hu wadya vileke wakikaule. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Uneva wakigamba kigojeni aaho mpaka suwe kize, nekikale aaho naho hekiwaitile. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Mna uneva wanagamba, Haya nyuwe kweleni mwize, niho nekiite kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu kakink'ha udahi wa kuwahuma. Naho iki nicho nekinde kilagiso kwetu.”<verse eid="1SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Ivo niyo wakelaviliza vileke Wafilisiti wawaone. Wafilisiti niyo wagamba, “Sinyeni wadya Waibulania walawa mwe mabome umwo wendile wakefisa!” <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Wafilisiti wendile mwe nk'hambi wamwitanga Yonasani na mbwanga amwinuilaga vitowanilo, “Sooni uku kwetu naswe nekiwalagise kint'hu.”<verse eid="1SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Ivo, Yonasani akwelagakwa kutambala uko kukenya akanda na yudya mbwanga. Yonasani awatowaga Wafilisiti akawakinya hasi uku yudya mbwanga akatimila kunyuma na kuwakoma. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Mwo kutowana kwa bosi Yonasani, akanda hamwenga na yudya mbwanga wakwe amwinuilaga vitoanilo, nakawakoma want'hu enga milongo miidi mwe nt'hendelo ya hasi dyabulaga nusu yo mgunda. <verse eid="1SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Mwe isi yose ya Wafilisiti, wose nawakonga kupata wogohi we nk'hondo mwe nk'hambi, want'hu mwe migunda, na want'hu wose wazingizaga, naho kwandaga na wogohi mkulu.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhumigwa kwa Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Na waamizi wa Sauli uko Gibea mwe isi ya Benjamini nawawaona want'hu wengi wakaguluka uku na uko. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Sauli niyo awagamba want'hu wandile hamwenga naye, hake kewazeni vileke kimanye niwahi hewemuli mwetu, weze wakewaze nawabunk'hula kugamba Yonasani na yudya mbwanga amwiinuilaga vitoanilo nawanda hawahali. <verse eid="1SA 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Sauli niyo amgamba Mlavant'hambiko Ahiya,“ Lete aha sanduku dya Mnungu.” Mwo lupisi ulwo Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Mnungu nedinda hamwenga na Waizilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Umwo Sauli anda akalonga no Mlavant'hambiko, kwaganika mwe nk'hambi ya Wafilisiti kwagendeelesaga, Sauli niyo amgamba Mlavant'hambiko, “Leka, usekudileta naho Disanduku dye Ndagano.” <verse eid="1SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Ivo Sauli na want'hu wakwe niyo wakeduganyaga niyo wakonga nk'hondo na Wafilisiti, mna Wafilisiti wakongaga kutoana wenye kwa wenye kwaviya nawakezaganya. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Ivo Waibulania awo wandaga hamwenga na Wafilisiti, na wadya waitaga nawo mwe nk'hambi, wahitukaga no kukelunga na Waizilaeli wakanda hamwenga na Sauli na Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Hata Waizilaeli watuhu wandile wakefisa mwe isi ya lugulu lwa Efulaimu, weze weve ivo Wafilisiti wandile wakaguluka, woho nawo wawagulusaga na kuwatowa.<verse eid="1SA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Ivo zuwa idyo Zumbe Mnungu awenk'haga Waizilaeli uhumi mkulu nk'hondo nayo yagendeelaga mpaka Beti Aveni.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yalaile mwe nk'hondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Zuwa diya, Waizilaeli wazehukaga ne sala kwaviya Sauli akelisaga akagamba, “Mnt'hu yeyose naadye nk'hande umwo kisingi kikanda kikei mpaka naaligitwe.” Ivo, zuwa idyo hakwandaga yeyose agezaga kudya nk'hande yeyose. <verse eid="1SA 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Fyo dyose dya watowani dize dibule hant'hu hana maziti mengi, wabwiilaga uki mwe kila ziti. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Mna hakwandaga na yeyose agezaga kuukwafa uki uwo kwaviya wogohaga diligito dya Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Mna Yonasani hamwivaga ise akalava kilapi. Ivo aonyekezaga ingoda andile nayo mwe dilala dyo uki, niyo adya uwo uki, aaho akeona kunda na ludole. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Mnt'hu yumwenga niyo amgamba, “Chose kizehuka na sala, mna iso kakilemeza kwa luhahila akagamba, ‘Naaligitwe yeyose naadye nk'hande yoyose diyelo.’”<verse eid="1SA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Yonasani niyo ahitula, “Tate awagela nk'huswank'huswa awant'hu, haluse miye nakeona nna ludole kwaviya hiluma uki uno mgeke! <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Nevindilisa vedi watowani wetu wadile ludodo kulawa mwe viya vitahigwe kulawa kwa wank'hondo wawe. Nekipata ludole na Wafilisiti wengi nawakomigwa”<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Mwe dizuwa diya, Waizilaeli wawatowaga Wafilisiti, kukongela Mikimashi mpaka Aiyaloni. Mwo lupisi ulo Waizilaeli nawanda wasokelesa. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Mna nawagulukila viya vint'hu vitahigwe, niyo waguha wana ngoto, majeku na ndama, wachinjaga, niyo wadya nyama ne sakame. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Want'hu wamgambaga Sauli, “Kaula want'hu wadamanya yaihile ha Zumbe Mnungu kwa kudya nyama ina sakame.” Sauli awagambaga want'hu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:33">“Nyuwe mhituka na kudamanya kint'hu kiihise!” “Tongoloseni iwe kulu aha hangu.” <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Niyo awagamba, “Iteni mkawagambile want'hu wose wegale ng'ombe na ngoto zawe aha, wazichinje na kuzidiila aaha. Msekudamanya wavu kwa Zumbe Mnungu, kwa kudya nyama ina sakame. Ivo kilo kiya chose nawegale ng'ombe zawe na kuzichinjila aaho.” <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Niyo Sauli Amzengela Zumbe Mnungu kilingo cha maiwe. Icho nicho chandaga kilingo cha maiwe cha nk'hongo Sauli amzengelaga Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="1SA 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Niyo Sauli awagamba want'hu, “Kiteni kiwabase Wafilisiti nekilo, kiwakump'hukile na kuutaha ugoli wao mpaka mtondo, hekimleke mnt'hu yeyose kunda mgima.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Want'hu niyo wamgamba, “Damanya kiya ukuona ni chedi kwako,” Mna mlavant'hambiko niyo amgamba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">“Kinde kumuuza Zumbe Mnungu.” <verse eid="1SA 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Ivo, Sauli niyo amuuza Mnungu, “Togola niite hawatowe Wafilisiti? Weye noukink'he ludole lwa kuwahuma?” Mna Mnungu hahitule mwe dizuwa idyo. <verse eid="1SA 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Niyo Sauli agamba, “Nyuwe vilongozi wa want'hu, soni kimanye ni wavu wani kidamanye diyelo. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Nakelisa kwa zina dya Zumbe Mnungu akuiyokola Izilaeli, hata uneva ni mwanangu Yonasani ni vedi akomigwe.” Mna hakuna mnt'hu alongile dyodyose. <verse eid="1SA 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Ivo, Sauli niyo awagamba, “Nyuwe nyose kimaleni nt'hendelo idya, miye name na Yonasani mwanangu kikimale nt'hendelo ino.” Woho niyo wahitula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:40">Woho niyo wahitula wakamgamba, “Damanya kiya ukuona chedi kwako,” <verse eid="1SA 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Niyo Sauli agamba, “We Zumbe Mnungu ywa Izilaeli, nii hunihitule miye mndima ywako? Weye Zumbe Mnungu ywa Izilaeli, uneva masa ye kwangu hegu kwa Yonasani, weye hitula kwa iwe dya Ulimu dya kuuza ulamuzi wako. Mna uneva masa ye kwa want'hu wa Izilaeli hitula kwa iwe dya Tumimu dya kuuza ulamuzi wako.” Yonasani na Sauli nawaonwa kunda na masa mna want'hu hawaonekaga kunda na masa. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Sauli niyo agamba toeni kula mwa miye na mwanangu Yonasani. Yonasani niyo abwiilwa na masa. <verse eid="1SA 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Niho Sauli amgamba Yonasani, nigambile idyo udamanye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:43">Yonasani niyo ahitula, “Nehidya uki mgeke kwa kudokola ne ngoda nnanayo mwo mkono, Naho uneva ni kubanika goja nibanike.”<verse eid="1SA 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Sauli niyo agamba, “Heiye Yonasani waungwa kubanika, Mnungu anitowe na kunikoma uneva huna banike kwajili ye mbuli ino!”<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Mna want'hu niyo wamgamba Sauli, “Nii Yonasani uyo awakombole Izilaeli akomigwe? Ni mbwani akomigwe? Chakelisa kwa zina dya Zumbe Mnungu, hata lufili lwo mtwi wakwe holugwe hasi. Iki adamanye dyelo kadamanya kwa wambizi wa Mnungu.” Ivo want'hu nawamyokola Yonasani, naye niyo hakomigwe.<verse eid="1SA 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Niyo Sauli aleka kuwatimila Wafilisiti, Wafilisiti nawo wauyaga kwe zikaya zawe.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulongozi wa Sauli ne nk'holo yakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Kukongela aho Sauli andaga seuta ywa Ezilaeli, atowanaga na wank'hondo wakwe kila hant'hu. Wamoabu na Waamoni na Waedomu na maseuta wa Soba, na Wafilisiti. Kila aho atowane nk'hondo andaga mhumi. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Atowanaga haheina kogoha, no kuwahuma Waameleki. Nakawayokola Waizilaeli mwa want'hu wose wandaga wawatahaga.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Wana kilume wa Sauli wandaga ni Yonasani na Ishivi na Malikiishua. Naho andaga na wanakike waidi. Mwelekwa ywa nk'hongo nakanda eketangwa Melabu, mdodo naye etangwagwa Mikali. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Mkaza Sauli etangwagwa Ahinomu mwana Ahimaasi. Mtowani wa watowani wa Sauli etangwagwa Abineli, uyo Neli mhwawe ywa Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Kishi niye Ise dya Sauli, Ise dya Abineli naye andaga ni Neli. Awa wose wandaga wana Abieli.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Kwandaga na nk'hondo nk'hulu mwa Waizilaeli na Wafilisiti mazuwa yose umwo Sauli andaga seuta, na kila aho Sauli eze ampate mnt'hu mta ludole hegu mta udahi wa nk'hondo, Sauli amguhaga vileke ande hamwenga na watowani wakwe.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe amlemela Sauli kunda seuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Samweli niyo amgamba Sauli, “Mnungu kanisigila hutende seuta ywa want'hu wakwe wa Izilaeli. Haluse tegeleza kiya Zumbe alongile. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" />Zumbe mta udahi kagamba ivi, ‘Naawasulumize Waameleki kwa kuwakindila Waizilaeli umwo wandaga mwe sila wakalawa Misili. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Haluse kawatowe Waamaleki niyo wawakoma pele woho na kila kint'hu chawe, usekuwazigaza hata yumwenga, wakome wagosi kwa wavele, wana na vititi, ng'ombe na ngoto na ngamia na mp'hunda.’”<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Sauli niyo awetanga watowani wakwe, niyo awaduganya hamwenga uko mzi wa Telaimu. Kwandaga na watowani magana maidi alufu wakugenda lwa viga kulawa Izilaeli, na watowani milongo alufu walawaga Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Sauli na want'hu wakwe waubasaga mzi wa Amaleki, niyo wakeika lumwe wakanyatila kwe dikolongo. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Sauli awagambaga Wakeni, “Halaweni, mlaweni mwa Waamaleki, vileke nisekuwakomani nyuwe hamwenga na woho, kwaviya mwalagisaga ukise kwa Wazilaeli wose umwo wandaga wakalawa Misili.” Ivo Wakeni wahalawaga ha Waamaleki.<verse eid="1SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />ivo Sauli na want'hu wakwe wawahumaga Wamaleki kulawa Havila mpaka Shuli, ulailo zuwa wa Misili. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Amgwilaga Agagi seuta ywa Amaleki akanda mgima, na wawakomaga pele want'hu wose. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Hiyo kugamba amlekaga Agagi kunda mgima du, mna iviyaiviya waviguhaga vint'hu vandaga vedi enga ngoto, mbuzi na ng'ombe. Waguhaga kila kint'hu chandaga chedi. Wakomaga du viya waonaga kunda hiyo vedi.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli alemelwa kunda seuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo amgamba Samweli. <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />“Kumbeke hitendile vedi kumtenda Sauli kunda seuta! Kanileka naho hatimile yadya nimgambile.” Samweli andaga na kinyulu niyo kilo chose anda akamwiila Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="1SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Mtotondo mwe dizuwa ditimile Samweli agendaga kumkaula Sauli. Evaga kugamba Sauli kaita kwo mzi wa Kalimeli uko akezengelaga mnala wakwe, naho niyo aita Giligali. <verse eid="1SA 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Umwo Samweli eze ambwiile Sauli, Sauli agambaga, “Zumbe Mnungu akuvikile kwaviya hidamanya enga ivo anigambile nidamanye.”<verse eid="1SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Samweli niyo amuuza, “Nii neva maizwi ya ngombe na ngoto?”<verse eid="1SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Sauli niyo ahitula, “Watowani wazitaha izi kwa Waamaleki wazigaza zingoto izedi na ng'ombe izedi wakamlavile nt'hambiko Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywako, mna visigale wavikoma pele.”<verse eid="1SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Samweli niyo amgamba Sauli, “Nyamala,” “Goja hugambile kiya Zumbe Mnungu anigambile mwe kilo chomboke.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:16">Sauli niyo agamba, “Nigambile.”<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Samweli niyo ahitula, “Hamwenga na kugamba wakeonaga kunda mdodo, Mnungu hakutendaga kunda mkulu mwe makabila yose ya Izilaeli? Zumbe Mnungu akutendaga kunda seuta ywa Izilaeli, <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />niyo akutuma uwakome pele want'hu wa Wamaleki awo ni wata wavu. Akugambaga uwatowe mpaka uwakome wose. <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Haluse nii hutimile viya Zumbe Mnungu alongile? Nii wagulukila kutaha niyo wadamanya uwihi kwa Zumbe Mnungu?”<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Sauli niyo ahitula, miye hitenda viya Zumbe Mnungu alongile, “Himwigala seuta Agagi niyo nawakoma Wamaleki wose. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Mna want'hu wangu waguhaga ngoto izedi na mbuzi na ng'ombe izedi mwe ziya watahile mna weza nazo aha Giligali wazilave nt'hambiko kwa Mnungu ywako.”<verse eid="1SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Mna Samweli niyo ahitula, “Ni kihi Zumbe Mnungu akuungisa? Togola Mnungu elelwa ni malavo ya kokwa na nt'hambiko viligane na kutimila yadya akulonga? Ni vedi kutimila yadya akulonga kujink'ha kumlavila mavuta ya vulata. <verse eid="1SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Kusaguka kulawa kwa Mnungu kwiha enga wavu wa usai naho unk'hani ni enga wavu wa kuvika mahili. Kwaviya weye kumlemela Zumbe Mnungu yehe naye kakulemela kunda seuta.”<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Sauli niyo ahitula, “Heye hidamanya wavu,” naho, “Hitendile yadya Zumbe Mnungu anisigiile hamwenga na malagizo yako. nehiwogoha want'hu kwaivo hitenda viya waungile woho. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Mna haluse, nakulombeza weye uniusile wavu wangu, naho kiuyanye vileke nidahe kumvika Zumbe Mnungu.”<verse eid="1SA 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Samweli niyo ahitula. “Mbwitu, Heniuye hamwenga na weye. Weye kulemela sigilizi za Zumbe Mnungu, yehe naye kakulemela kunda seuta ywa Izilaeli.”<verse eid="1SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Umwo Samweli eze ahituke vileke ahalawe, Sauli atozaga divalo dya Samweli, niyo dyatatuka. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Samweli niyo amgamba, “Zumbe kauhausa useuta wa Izilaeli kulawa kwako kukongela ivi dyelo, niyo awink'hiza kwa miyawo ywedi kujink'ha weye. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Uyo Mnungu ywa Izilaeli mta Udahi hakulonga lulimi na kuhitula zifanyanyi zakwe kwaviya yehe hiyo mnt'hu akuhitula zifanyanyi zakwe.”<verse eid="1SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Sauli niyo ahitula, “Miye hidamanya wavu. Mna usekunigela soni aha ha wadala wa want'hu wangu na Waizilaeli wose, kiuyanye vileke hamvike Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywako.” <verse eid="1SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Ivo, Samweli auyaga hamwenga na Sauli, Sauli naye niyo amvika Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Samweli niyo agamba, “Mlete kwangu seuta Agagi. Agagi ezaga kwa Samweli kwa kinyemi akagamba, ikindedi usungu we file womboka.” <verse eid="1SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Samweli niyo agamba, “Enga iivo sime yako iwatendile wavele wengi kubanikilwa ni wana wawe, haluse nyokwe naye naande abanikilwe ni wana mwa wavele.” Ivo Samweli amdangagadangaga Agagi uko Giligali ha Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Ivo Samweli niyo aita Lama, mna Sauli aitaga kwe kaya yakwe uko Gibea. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Kukongela mwe dizuwa idyo Samweli hamuonaga naho Sauli, hamwenga na ayo Samweli amwiilaga Sauli, mna Zumbe niyo agamba hitendile vedi kwa kumtenda Sauli kunda seuta mwe Izilaeli. Naho Samweli hagendaga kumuwona naho Sauli mpaka kwe dizua dyo kubanika kwakwe.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Daudi akumbigwa mafuta ande seuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo amgamba Samweli, “Noumwiile Sauli mpaka ini? Miye himlemela kunda seuta ywa Izilaeli. Haluse memeza imp'hembe mavuta ya zeituni niyo waita Betelehemu kwa mnt'hu akwitangwa Yese, kwaviya hisagula yumwenga mwa wanawe we kilume ande seuta.”<verse eid="1SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Samweli niyo auza, “Nadaha vivihi kutenda ivi?” “Uneva Sauli eneva mbuli iyo, naa nikome!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:2">Zumbe Mnungu niyo ahitula, “Guha moli imwenga niyo waita nayo, niyo wagamba weye kwiza kumlavila Zumbe Mnungu nt'hambiko. <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Mlalike Yese mwe nt'hambiko iyo na miye nohugambile kint'hu cho kudamanya. Noumkumbe mavuta kwajili yangu ande seuta yudya mnt'hu nohugambile.”<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Samweli adamanyaga enga ivo agambilwe ni Mnungu, niyo aita Betelehemu. Wadala wo mzi uwo niyo wafosa na kumsingila wakanda wazingiza, niyo wamuuza, “Togola, kwiza kwa utondowazi?”<verse eid="1SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Samweli niyo ahitula, “Heye, Hiza kwa utondowazi. Hiza kumlavila nt'hambiko Mnungu. Kekukizeni naho soni kinde hamwenga mwe nt'hambiko.” Naho amkukizaga Yese na wanawe, na kuwalalika mwe nt'hambiko.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Umwo weze wabule, Samweli amounaga Eliyabu mwana Yese, afanyanyaga mwenye, “Mnt'hu uyu akimale aha ha Zumbe ikindedi niye asagulwe.” <verse eid="1SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Mna Zumbe Zumbe niyo amgamba Samweli, “Usekumsinya futa yakwe na utali wakwe kwaviya miye himlemela. Kwaviya Zumbe hakukaula mwe vint'hu viya vikukaulwa ni want'hu. Want'hu wakaula enga ivo mnt'hu eli kwa kuse, mna Zumbe Mnungu akaula kwo moyo wo mnt'hu.”<verse eid="1SA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Ivo, Yese niyo amwitanga mwanawe Abinadabu no kumleta kwa Samweli. Mna Samweli niyo agamba, “Bule, Zumbe Mnungu hamsagule hata uyu.” <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Yese niyo amleta Shamea. Samweli niyo agamba, “Bule, Zumbe Mnungu hamsagule hata uyu,” <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Yese niyo anda kawaleta wanawe wose mfungate kwa Samweli. Mna Samweli amgambaga Yese, “Bule Zumbe Mnungu hasagule yeyose mwa awa.” <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Samweli niyo amuuza Yese, “Togola, una wana watuhu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Yese niyo ahitula, “Kasigala mbwanga kamwenga, mna hakahali e kwo kudima zingoto.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">“Samweli niyo amgamba, kagambe keze aha, hekikale hasi kidye mpaka uyo mbwanga keze aha.” <verse eid="1SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Ivo Yese niyo asigiila mnt'hu, niyo agenda kumguha. Andaga kabwanga katana, kata meso yasangaale. Mnungu niyo amgamba Samweli, “Hoo, haluse uyu niye nimsagule, mkumbe mavuta ande seuta.” <verse eid="1SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Samweli niyo aguha mp'hembe yakwe ina mavuta no kumgidila mavuta ha wakuluze, aaho Muye ywa Mnungu amwizilaga Daudi kwa udahi, nae andaga naye kukongela dizua diya na kugendeela. Ivo Samweli niyo auya kwo mzi wa Lama.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi he sebule ya Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Ivo, Muye ywa Mnungu afosaga mwa Sauli, niyo muye aihile atumigwe ni Zumbe Mnungu amgela makunt'ho. <verse eid="1SA 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Niho wandima wakwe Sauli wakamgamba, “Kimanya kugamba, muye aihile atumigwe ni Mnungu akugela makunt'ho. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Haluse, weye zumbe ywetu, wagambe wandima wako wamzungule mnt'hu amanyize kutoa kinubi, umwo muye aihile atumigwe ni Mnungu aho akwiziila, mnt'hu uyo naatoe kinubi, weye nawe nounde ywedi naho.”<verse eid="1SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Sauli niyo awagamba wandima wakwe, “Nizunguileni mnt'hu amanyize kutoa kinubi, mnigaile aha.”<verse eid="1SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Mbwanga yumwenga mwa wandima wakwe niyo agamba, “Himuona mbwanga yumwenga mwana Yese, wo mzi wa Betelehemu. Mbwanga uyo kamanya kutoa kinubi. Uyo mbwanga ni mtowani, ni mhumi wa kutoana nk'hondo, ana ulosi wedi naho mta futa yedi, Mnungu ehamwenga naye.”<verse eid="1SA 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Ivo, Sauli asigiilaga ulosi kwa Yese, akagamba, “Nitangile mwanawo Daudi, mdimi ywe zingoto na mbuzi.” <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Yese amtumaga Daudi aite kwa Sauli akanda na mbuzi na mp'hunda inule mikate na bete dimemile divai. <verse eid="1SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Daudi ezaga kwa Sauli niyo engila mwe ndima yakwe. Sauli niyo amuungisa Daudi, aho amwink'haga ndima ya kwinula vitowanilo vakwe. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Ivo Sauli egalaga ulosi kwa Yese akagamba, “Namuunga Daudi, ekale aha ande mndima ywangu.” <verse eid="1SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Lupisi lwolwose kukongela aho na kugendeela, yudya muye aihile atumigwe ni Mnungu akamwiziila Sauli, niho Daudi aguhaga kinubi chakwe niyo atowa. Muye yudya aihile niyo amlekela. Aho Sauli akeivaga vedi.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Goliati awabela Waislaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Haluse, Wafilisiti nawaduganya watowani wawe uko Soko, mzi umwe isi ya Yuda, kukeika lumwe kwa nk'hondo. Nawatowa nk'hambi uko Efese Damimu mgati mwa Soko na Azeka. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Sauli na Waizilaeli nawadugana hamwenga, na kutoa nk'hambi mwa kagulu kakukaula dikolongo dya Ela. Na kukeika lumwe kutoana na Wafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Wafilisiti nawakimala mwo lugulu lumwenga na Waislaeli lugulu lutuhu, kwandaga kolongo hagati yawe.<verse eid="1SA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Kulawa mwe nk'hambi ya Wafilisiti, nakakelaviliza mnk'hondo yumwenga akwitangwa Goliati, mkaya ywa mzi wa Gati. Utali wakwe noubula mita nt'hatu. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Mwo mntwi wakwe nakavala nk'hofia ya shaba, na kizibau cha shaba mwe kifua cha kilo milongo mishano na mfungate. <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />Viga vakwe nevinda na wamizi wa shaba na mwe maega yakwe enulaga mjungo wa shaba. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Mhini wa mjungo wakwe nounda mkulu enga mfunda. Mntwi wo mjungo wakwe nounda wa kilo mfungate. Ngula yakwe neinulwa ni mnt'hu amlongoele. <verse eid="1SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Goliati nakakimala no kuwatoela lwasu watowani wa Izilaeli, akagamba, “Mwadamanyai aho? Togola, mwiza kutoana nk'hondo? Miye ni Mfilisiti, nyuwe ni watumwa wa Sauli. Saguleni mnt'hu ywenyu yumwenga eze kitowane. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Ananihuma na kunikoma, suwe nekinde watumwa wenyu. Mna nna mhuma na kumkoma iivo, nyuwe nomnde watumwa wetu wakukidamanyila ndima. <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Niyo Mfilisiti uyo kalonga kwa kukeduvya, nawaunga watowani wa Izilaeli mwe dizuwa idi mumlave mnt'hu yumwenga eze kitowane!” <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Sauli hamwenga na watowani wa Izilaeli weze weve ulosi wo Mfilisiti uyo, wahuzaga na kogohesa.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi mwe nk'hambi ya Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Daudi andaga mwana wa Yese, Mwefulati kulawa Betelehemu ya Yuda. Yese nakanda na wana mnane wa kilume. Aho Sauli eze ande seuta, yehe nakanda mdala, mnt'hu ywa lika kulu. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Wadya wana watatu wa Yese wandile wakulu nawanda watimilana na Sauli kwe nk'hondo, mazina ayo ya wanawe watatu wa Yese waitile kwe nk'hondo ni aya, nt'hula sasu Eliyabu, na ywa kaidi ni Abinadabu na ywa katatu ni Shama. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />Daudi naye andaga niye kiziwanda mwa wose, naho awo watatu wendile wakulu nawo nawakatimilana na Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />Mna Daudi andaga akaita kwa Sauli na kuuya vileke ande akadima zingoto za ise uko Betelehemu.<verse eid="1SA 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Kwa mazua milongo mine, yudya Mfilisiti akelavilizaga mtondo na kisingi akawabela watowani wa Waizilaeli.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Zuwa dimwenga, Yese amgambaga mwanawe Daudi, “Wegaile wakuluwo mkazingo kilo mlongo na mikate mlongo. Sunguza uwegaile uko kwe nk'hambi. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Yudya mkulu ywawe ywa watowani alufu umwigaile vibesu mlongo va samli inyaile. Kawakaule wakuluzo uneva wagendeela vedi niyo wanigila uhituzi wao. <verse eid="1SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Lupisi ulo seuta Sauli na wakuluze dya Daudi na watowani wose wa Izilaeli nawatowa nk'hambi kwe dikolongo dya Ela, wakakeikaa lumwe watowane na Wafilisiti.”<verse eid="1SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Luvi yakwe, Daudi enukaga kilokilo, zingoto nazo amlekelaga mdimi. Aviguhaga vint'hu via niyo aita enga ivo Yese amsigiilaga. Eze abule mwe nk'hambi ya Waizilaeli, awabwiilaga wakepanga hant'hu hawe ha nk'hondo wakatoa nk'hunga za nk'hondo. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Watowani wa Wafilisiti na watowani Waizilaeli wakeikaga lumwe watowane, wakakaulana kinga'mbu king'ambu. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Daudi amwasiliga ink'hande mnt'hu yudya andaga akamila zint'hanu zawo, niyo awagulukila watowani niyo abula na kuwalamsa wanduguze. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Umwo andaga akalonga nawo, Goliati yudya mtowani mdahi ywa Wafilisiti kulawa Gati kakelaviliza ha watowani wa Izilaeli enga ivo azoele. Daudi naye amtegelezaga vedi. <verse eid="1SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Waizilaeli wose weze wamuone Goliati, wogohesaga na kunyilika. <verse eid="1SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Wakakegamba, “Togoleni, mmuona mnt'hu yudya akelavilize? Ikindedi kakelaviliza kuwabela Waizilaeli. Seuta Sauli naamwink'he ugoli utendese mnt'hu yeyose naamkome mnt'hu uyo. Mwa ayo yose namloze mwanawe ywa kike. Naho want'hu wo lukolo lwa ise nawalekelwe, hawalihe kodi.”<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Daudi niyo awauza wadya wendile hagihi naye, “Togola, mnt'hu naamkome Mfilisiti uyu na kuiyokola Izilaeli viligane na soni izi naadamanyilwe mbwai? Uyu Mfilisiti heevinilwe niye ani hegoha kuwahomola watowani wa Mnungu eli mgima?” <verse eid="1SA 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Want'hu niyo wamgambila enga ivo walongile aho nk'hongo kwa uyo naamkome Goliati.<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Mna Eliyabu, mkuluwe Daudi eze amwive Daudi akalonga na want'hu, andaga na maya kwaajili ya Daudi, niyo amgamba, “Kubasai uku? Togola, zingoto zia zingeke kumwasila ani kudya kwe nyika? Miye himanya weduvi wako na ivo wili umoyo wako. Kwaviya weye kwiza du kukaula ink'hondo!”<verse eid="1SA 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />Daudi niyo amwihitula, “Haluse hibanagai? Miye nehauza du?” <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Daudi niyo amwihitukila mnt'hu mtuhu akamuuza enga ivo auzile, naho kila akausa apataga uhituzi uudya.<verse eid="1SA 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Want'hu awo wamwivile Daudi ivo alongile, nawaita kumgambila Sauli. Sauli niyo asigiila Daudi etangwe. <verse eid="1SA 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Daudi niyo amgamba Sauli, “Mnt'hu yeyose asekwingila chevu kwajili yo mnt'hu uyu Mfilisiti. Miye mndima ywako neniite hatowane naye.”<verse eid="1SA 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Sauli niyo amgamba Daudi, “Bule, weye hukudaha kugenda kutowana na yudya Mfilisiti. Weye wi mbwanga du, mna mnt'hu uyu nakanda mtowani ywa nk'hondo kukongela aho andaga mbwanga!”<verse eid="1SA 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Niyo agamba, “Miye mndima,” ywako, “Hizoela kudima ngoto za tate, kila lupisi simba hegu suwi zikeza kugwila mwana ngoto, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />miye nazibasa no kuzitowa, na kumuyokola mwana ngoto mwo mnomo wakwe. Naho simba hegu sangalugembe inanikump'hukila, miye nazitoza zindevu zawe niyo naitowa na kuikoma. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Miye mndima ywako hikoma simba nyingi na sangalugembe. Haluse, hata yudya Mfilisiti hevinilwe, yudya awahomole watowani wa Mnungu eli mgima, naande enga izo zisimba ne zisangalugembe izo. <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />Yudya Zumbe aniyokole mwo mnomo we simba hegu sangalugembe, naaniyokole mwa yudya Mfilisiti.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:37">Sauli niyo amgamba. “Ita, Mnungu naande hamwenga na weye.” <verse eid="1SA 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Sauli niyo amvika Daudi zisuke zakwe ze nk'hondo, kamvika nk'hofia yakwe ya shaba mwo mtwi na kizibau cha shaba cha kukekindila mwe kifuwa chakwe. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Daudi niyo akenyinya sime ya Sauli mwe divalo yakwe, no kugeza kugenda, mna niyo adunduga kugenda kwaviya havizoele, niyo amgamba Sauli, “Hikudaha kutowana ne vint'hu ivi, kwaviya hivizoele.” Ivo Daudi niyo azihambula. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Daudi aguhaga ingoda yakwe na kuitoza mwo mkono, niyo asagula maiwe mashano yedi ya mbulanga, no kuyagela mwo mfuko wakwe wa kudimila, akanda kaikalumwe nk'humbaiwe yakwe mwo mkono, niyo akonga kumbasa Goliati Mfilisiti.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi amhuma Goliati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Yudya Mfilisiti, naye akongaga kumbasa Daudi, yudya amguhile ingao yakwe naye akanda halongole hakwe. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Yudya Mfilisiti eze amkaule na kumuwona vedi Daudi, niyo ambela, kwaviya nakanda mbwanga du naho kadamanya va kuwagila mwa meso. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Goliati amuuzaga Daudi, “Haluse iyo ngoda yai? Kwani miye ni kuli vikuleka unizile na ngoda? Mfilisiti uyo niyo amligita Daudi kwa milungu yakwe ye Kifilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Mfilisiti niyo amgamba Daudi, So uku, name ikimba chako nenikink'hize kwa madege ya kulanga na makala ya kwe mbago.”<verse eid="1SA 17:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />Mna Daudi niyo amgamba Goliati, “Weye wanizila kwa bamba na mjungo na sime. Mna miye nakwizila kwa zina dya Zumbe Mnungu ywa watowani wa Izilaeli, yudya weye umhomole. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Zuwa dya dielo Mnungu naanink'he udahi wa kukuhuma. Nohuduule hasi no kuukant'ha mtwi wako, ne vimba va watowani wako Wafilisiti neniwenk'he madege ya kulanga na makala ya kwe mbago. Naho kugamba isi yose neimanye kugamba eyuko Mnungu mwe Izilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />Want'hu wose wadugane aha dielo, nawamanye kugamba Zumbe Mnungu hakukombola want'hu kwa mijungo hegu sime. Nk'hondo ino ya Zumbe Mnungu, naye kakink'ha ludole lwa kuwahumani nyuwe nyose.”<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Goliati akongaga naho kumbasa Daudi. Daudi naye niyo amgulukila akatowane nae Goliati Mfilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Daudi agelaga mkono wakwe mwo mfuko na kulava iwe dimwenga niyo adiduula kwa nk'humbaiwe yakwe, nakumtoa nadyo Goliati mwe kihanga chakwe. Iwe dyatulaga kihanga cha Goliati na kwingila kundani. Goliati agwaga hasi kifulifuli. <verse eid="1SA 17:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />Nivo Daudi amhumile Goliati kwa nk'humbaiwe ne diiwe dyakwe, na kamtoa yudya Mfilisiti. Daudi nakanda hana bamba dyodyose mwo mkono wakwe, <verse eid="1SA 17:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />niyo aguluka nguluko, no kukimala mnanga mwa Goliati, niyo asomola dibamba dya Goliati mwe yala yakwe, niyo amkant'ha Goliati mtwi wakwe ne dibamba iidyo. Wafilisiti weze waone mtowani ywawe mdahi kakomigwa, watulaga nguluko niyo wanyilika. <verse eid="1SA 17:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Niho want'hu wa Izilaeli na want'hu wa Yuda, wakongaga kuguta lukunga lwa uhumi, no kuwagulusa Wafilisiti mpaka Gati, mwe nk'hili ya Ekuloni. Wafilisiti walumilaga mwe nk'hondo nawasambala mwe sila ya Shalimu mpaka Gati na Ekuloni. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Mna Wazilaeli weze wauye kulawa kwo kuwagulusa Wafilisiti, waitahaga ink'hambi ya Wafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Daudi niyo aguha mtwi wa yudya Goliati Mfilisiti no kuwigala kwo mzi wa Yelusalemu, Mna vitoanilo vakwe aviikaga mwe dihema dyakwe.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi egalwa kwa Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Sauli eze amuone Daudi akambasa yudya Mfilisiti Goliati, nakamuuza Abineli, kilongozi ywa mtowani wakwe, “Abineli, uyu mbwanga ywaani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:55">Abineli niyo ahitula, “Ikindedi miye himanyize.”<verse eid="1SA 17:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Ivo seuta Sauli niyo amgamba, “Genda kauze kugamba mbwanga ywa ani.”<verse eid="1SA 17:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Umwo Daudi eze ajike kumkoma Goliati no kuuya kwe nk'hambi, Abineli nakamguha no kumwiigala kwa Sauli. Lupisi ulo Daudi nakanda akei anawo umtwi wa Goliati Mfilisiti mwe mikono yakwe. <verse eid="1SA 17:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Sauli niyo amuuza Daudi, “Mbwanga, weye mwana anii?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:58">“Daudi niyo ahitula miye ni mwana mndima ywako Yese kulawa Betelehemu.”<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Sauli eze ajike kulonga na Daudi, Yonasani mwana ywa Sauli nakeleleswa ni Daudi, na kumuungisa kwa moyo wakwe wose enga ivo yehe mwenye akeungise. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Kukongela zuwa idyo Sauli amguhaga Daudi kwita kwakwe, naho hamlekile auye kwe kaya ya Ise. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Kwaviya Yonasani nakambwedesa Daudi enga yehe mwenye, niyo aikaika Ndagano naye. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Nakahambula divalo dyakwe availe na kumwink'ha Daudi hamwenga na vitoanilo vakwe, ne sime no uta no mkanda wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Ivo Daudi nakaita kila hant'hu uko atumigwe ni Sauli, akadamanya kwa umanyi, Sauli niyo amwika kulanga mwa watowani. Mbuli ino niyo yanda yedi mwa want'hu wose, na mwa meso ya wandima wa Sauli.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli amuonela finju Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Watowani weze wauye kaya, hamwenga na Daudi ivo amkomile yudya Mfilisiti, wavele kulawa kwo mzi wa Izilaeli wagendaga kumsingila seuta Sauli. Wavele nawo wakemaga wila we kinyemi, wakatoa ngoma na ving'weng'we. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Naho nawanda wakavina na kukema mila ya kuzumilana wakagamba, “Sauli kakoma maalufu yakwe, Daudi naye kakoma milongo ealufu yakwe.” <verse eid="1SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Sauli helelwe, ne zimbuli zo wila uwo, ivo niyo engila maya vitendese akagamba, “Wamwink'ha Daudi milongo alufu, mna miye wanink'ha elufu du. Kisigale ni kumwink'ha Daudi useuta.” <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Sauli niyo anda hamhuwile naho Daudi kukongela dizuwa idyo.<verse eid="1SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Zuwa ditimile, muye mwavu atumigwe ni Mnungu amwingilaga Sauli kwa kipump'ha, niyo anda alalata enga mkilalu mwe nyumba yakwe. Daudi andaga akatoa kinubi enga ivo azoele mazuwa yose. Sauli nakanda na mjungo mwo mkono wakwe, <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />Sauli niyo amduila mjungo uwo akagamba, “Neni muwambe Daudi mwo lukazi.” Mna Daudi awink'haga sili nk'hanana mbili.<verse eid="1SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Sauli niyo amwogoha Daudi, kwaviya Zumbe nakanda hamwenga na Daudi na kumleka Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Ivo, Sauli niyo amuusaga hakwe na kumtenda ande kilongozi wa watowani alufu imwenga. Daudi naye niyo alongoza vedi kwe nk'hondo. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />Daudi andaga mpati ywa kila kint'hu kwaviya Zumbe andaga hamwenga naye. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Sauli eze aone kugamba kila kint'hu akudamanya Daudi chagenda vedi, amwogohesaga. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Mna want'hu wose wa Izilaeli na Yuda nawamuungisa Daudi kwaviya nakawalongoza vedi mwe nk'hondo na kuwavuza kwa wedi.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi amlomba mwana Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Sauli niyo amgamba Daudi, “Uyu Melabi niye mwanangu ywe kike mkulu, nohuloze ande mkazio uneva unadamanya mbuli izi zimbili. Unde mtowani ywangu mdahi naho utowane nk'hondo ya Zumbe. Sauli naakafanyanya mwo moyo wakwe akakegamba, Hiyo miye neni mkome, uyu naakomwe ni Wafilisiti!” <verse eid="1SA 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Daudi niyo amgamba Sauli, “Ni miye ani vikuleka seuta ande mkwangu?” Lukolo lwangu mwenye na mp'huga ya Tate halumanyikise mwe Izilaeli. <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Mna, lupisi ludya Melabu mwana kike ywa Sauli uyo naakaunga lobigwe ni Daudi, nakalozwa kwa Adilieli kulawa kwo mzi wa Mehola.<verse eid="1SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Hata ivo, Mikali mwana kike mtuhu ywa Saulii naka muungisa Daudi. Sauli eze agambilwe nakeleleswa. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Sauli nakafanyanya mwenye akagamba, “Goja nimloze uyu ande lwinika kwakwe, na ivo Wafilisiti nawa mkome. Ivo Sauli kamgambaga kaidi naho, haluse nounde mkwangu.” <verse eid="1SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Ivo Sauli awalagiza wandima wakwe, simuileni na Daudi kwa kinyele, no kugamba, “Kaula seuta akuungisa weye na wandima wakwe wose wakuungisa, weye nawe unde mkwewe dya seuta.”<verse eid="1SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Na awo wandima wa Sauli niyo walonga mbuli izo na Daudi, Daudi niyo awagamba, “Togoleni nyuwe mwaona kugamba ni vihufu kunda mkwewe dya seuta? Miye ni mkiwa nenidahe vivihi kuliha mali kwa seuta.”<verse eid="1SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Wadya wandima wamgambilaga Sauli enga ivo Daudi agambile. <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Sauli naye niyo agamba, “Mgambileni Daudi, seuta hakuunga ugoli wowose, mna aunga machupu gana ya Wafilisiti hewivinilwe, vileke awatendele Wafilisiti wiihi enga ivo wamtendele.” <verse eid="1SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Wandima wakwe nawo weze wamgambile Daudi mbuli izo, Daudi nakeleleswa kunda mkwewe dya seuta naho umwo mazua ye ndoza yandaga yakei mpaka, <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />Daudi aitaga na want'hu wakwe, niyo wawakoma Wafilisiti magana maidi. Niyo aguha machupu na kuyegala kwa seuta. Sauli naye niyo amloza mwana kike ywakwe Mikali.<verse eid="1SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Sauli abunk'hulaga kugamba Zumbe andaga hamwenga na Daudi, naho Mikali mwana kike ywakwe amuungisaga Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />Sauli agendeelaga kumwogoha Daudi. Sauli niyo anda mk'hondo ywa Daudi mazuwa yose.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Watowani wa Wafilisiti wagendaga kutowana na Waizilaeli, mna mwe kila nk'hondo Daudi andaga mhumi kujink'ha wandima wa Sauli. Ivo Zina dya Daudi dyagendeelaga kutogoleswa.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Sauli ageza kumkoma Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Sauli nakamgamba mwanawe Yonasani na wandima wakwe wose wamkome Daudi, mna Yonasani, mwanawe Sauli, nakamuungisa Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />kwaivo, niyo amgambila, “Tate aunga akukome. Ivo, kesinyise, luvi mtondo, kefise hant'hu ha kinyele, wikale uuko. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Miye nenize na tate no kukimala hagihi na Tate uko kwo mgunda hant'hu nounde kukefisa. Aho nenilonge naye kwaajili ya weye, na kint'hu chochose nenibunk'hule nohugambile.”<verse eid="1SA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Yonasani naka mtogolesa Daudi kwa Ise akamgamba, “Usekudamanya wiihi kwa mndima ywako Daudi kwaviya yehe hadamanye wiihi wowose kwako; Udamanyi wakwe wose wa kukudamanyila weye ni wedi mazuwa yose. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Daudi hegu nakabanika umwo agendaga kutowana na Mfilisiti Goliati, Mna Zumbe Mnungu awenk'haga uhumi mkulu Waizilaeli. Weye mwenye waionaga imbuli iyo niyo wanda na kinyemi. Haluse nii waunga udamanye wiihi kwa kumkoma Daudi haheina masa?”<verse eid="1SA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Sauli nakamtegeleza Yonasani, niyo aika kilapi, “Nakelisa ha Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi, henimkome Daudi.” <verse eid="1SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Niyo, Yonasani kamwitanga Daudi no kumgambila mbuli izo zose. Yonasani niyo amwigala Daudi kwa Sauli, na Daudi niyo amdamnyila ndima enga aho nk'hongo.<verse eid="1SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Naho akajika nokunda na nk'hondo ya Wafilisiti na Waizilaeli naho. Daudi afosaga kugenda kutowana na Wafilisiti, yehe niyo awakoma Wafilisiti wengi, wasigale niyo wanyilika. <verse eid="1SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Zuwa dimwenga muye aihile atumigwe ni Zumbe Mnungu amwiziila Sauli umwo andile kekala mwe nyumba yakwe akanda no mjungo mwo mkono, Daudi naye andaga akatowa kinubi.<verse eid="1SA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Sauli nakageza kumjunga no mjungo Daudi, mna Daudi niyo awink'ha sila, mjungo wa Sauli nawo niyo wakujunga kwo lukandula. Daudi niyo anyilika. <verse eid="1SA 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Kilo iicho, Sauli nakasiigila want'hu kwe kaya ya Daudi wamkaule uneva eyaho vileke amkome nomtondo. Mna Mikali, mkaziwe Daudi niyo amgambila Daudi, “Uneva huna nyilike kilo iki luvi noukomigwe.” <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Ivo Mikali niyo amwambiza Daudi kuseela mwe dilanga, naye niyo afosa na kunyilika. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Mikali aguhaga hili, niyo kudigoneza mwo luzazi naho mwo mtwi we dihili idyo adi vikaga mazoya ya mbuzi niyo adigubikaga dihili ne suke. <verse eid="1SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Sauli eze asigiile want'hu wamgwile Daudi, Mikali awagambaga Daudi mnyonge. <verse eid="1SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Niyo Sauli awatuma wauye uuko naho, akawasigiila kugamba akagamba, “Mleteni Daudi kwangu hata uneva emwo lusazi vileke akomigwe.” <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Wadya want'hu weze wengile mwe nyumba ya Daudi na kusinya lusazi, nawaona mna hili na mto wa mazoya ya mbuzi mwo mtwi. <verse eid="1SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Sauli niyo amgamba Mikali, “Nii ukanidant'hiliza ivo na kumleka mnk'hondo ywangu aninyilike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:17">Mikali naye niyo amhitula Sauli, “Yehe nakanigamba, hegu nakanikoma wandile hyamwambize vileke anyilike. ”<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Daudi eze anyilike, aitaga kwo mzi wa Lama kwa Samweli. Amgambilaga zimbuli zose adamanyilwe ni Sauli. Ivo, Daudi na Samweli nawaita kwikala Nayoti niyo inyumba ya walotezi. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Sauli naye niyo agambilwa kugamba Daudi nakanda mwe nyumba ya walotezi mwo mzi wa Lama. <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Niho Sauli atumaga want'hu wakamgwiile. Mna weze wabwiile difyo dya walavant'hambiko dikalotela Samweli naye akadilongoza. Muye ywa Mnungu nouwezila wadya wegala ulosi wa Sauli, woho nao niyo wakonga kulotela uku wakavina na kubongeela. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Sauli eze agambilwe mbuli izo, atumaga wandima watuhu, woho nawo iviyaiviya niyo wakonga kulotela uku wakavina na kubongeela. Sauli eze atume wandima watuhu katatu, iviyaiviya nawakonga kulotela uku wakavina na kubongeela. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Naho akajika aitaga Lama yehe mwenye. Eze abule mwe disima dikulu dili uko Seku, auzaga kugamba, “Samweli na Daudi we hii?” Uyo mnt'hu niyo amhitula, “Weyaho Nayoti, mwo mzi wa Lama.” <verse eid="1SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Sauli naye niyo aita uko Nayoti kwo mzi wa Lama. Eze abule uko, Muye ywa Mnungu amwiziilaga, naye niyo akonga kulotela sila yose mpaka Nayoti mwo mzi wa Lama. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />Ahambulaga mavalo yakwe niyo alotela ha Samweli. Ekalaga kimbwigili kwa zuwa dimwenga, kilo na msi. Kwa ivo want'hu nawakonga kukeuza, “Togola, Sauli naye kanda yumwenga ywa walotezi?”<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Yonasani amwambiza Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Daudi niyo anyilikila Nayoti mwo mzi wa Lama, niyo aita mpaka kwa Yonasani, na kumgamba, “Hibanangai? Nna masa yani? Wavu wani nidamanye kwa iso vikuleka anikome?” <verse eid="1SA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Yonasani niyo amhitula, “Idyo dinde hale na weye. Houbanike. Tate haadamanye mbuli yeyose, dinde kulu hegu ndodo, haheina kunigambila. Hata mbuli ino hakudaha kunifisa!” <verse eid="1SA 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Daudi niyo aika kilapi, akagamba, “Kindedi iso kamanya vedi ivo ukuniungisa, niyo alonga mwo moyo wakwe mwenye akagamba, Yonasani hakuungwa kumanya imbuli ino, sema anengile kinyulu. Mna nalonga kindedi ha Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi kugamba, file ihagihi na miye!”<verse eid="1SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Yonasani niyo amgamba, “Dyodyose noulonge nohudamanyile.”<verse eid="1SA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />Daudi niyo amgamba, “Luvi ni kinyemi cho kulawa mnenge, naho nakawiilwa kudya nk'hande hamwenga na seuta. Mna nileke hakefise uko kwo mgunda mpaka zuwa dya katatu kisingi. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />Iso hananione mwo kudya nk'hande, naho uneva ananiuza mbuli zangu mgambile, Daudi kanihembeleza nimwink'he luneka vileke aite kwo mzi kwakwe Betelehemu, kudamanya nt'hambiko ya kila mwaka hamwenga no lukolo lwakwe. <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Uneva iso ana gamba ‘Vedi,’ Miye mndima ywako neninde na utondowazi. Mna ananda na maya, umanye akawiila kunidamanyila mbuli iihile. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Ivo nidamanyile kwa kuunga kwako kwaviya kuika ndagano ikukile na miye, miye mndima ywako ha Zumbe Mnungu. Mna uneva hibalanga, nikome weye mwenye, nii unigale kwa iso vileke anikome?”<verse eid="1SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Yonasani niyo ahitula, “Bule, fanyanyi iyo inde hale na weye, uneva namanyize kugamba tate nakakuungila yaihile weye, nehinda hikukufisa?”<verse eid="1SA 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Daudi niyo auza, “Nenimanye vivihi uneva iso nakuhitule kwa luhahila?”<verse eid="1SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Yonasani niyo amhitula, “Soo kite kwo mgunda!” Ivo niyo waita. <verse eid="1SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Yonasani niyo amgamba Daudi, “Zumbe Mnungu ywa Izilaeli ande muwona ywetu. Luvi hegu kisindo lupisi enga ulu nenimuuze tate. Inanda fanyanyi zakwe mwa weye ni zedi nohugambile.” <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Zumbe Mnungu anikome uneva Sauli afanyanya kukukoma, miye name nohwiike hale aho nowinde na utondowazi. Zumbe Mnungu ande hamwenga na weye enga ivo andile hamwenga na tate! <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Naho uneva nenigendeele kunda mgima, weye toza kiya kilapi kikukise na unde mhuwilwa, uneva nna banika, <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" />usekuleka kuwaambiza want'hu we mp'huga yangu kwa uhuwilwa mazuwa yose. Zumbe Mnungu naye, aho akeza kwiza kuwakoma pele wank'hondo wangu kulawa mwe isi, <verse eid="1SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />Ivo Yonasani aikaga ndagano ne nyumba ya Daudi umwo akagamba, “Zumbe Mnungu awakome pele wank'hondo wa Daudi.”<verse eid="1SA 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Kwa lupisi lutuhu naho, Yonasani amgambaga Daudi aike kilapi viligane na lukunde lwakwe kwa Yonasani, kwaviya amuungisaga Daudi enga ivo akeungise yehe mwenye. <verse eid="1SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Niyo amgamba Daudi, “Luvi ni kinyemi cho kulawa mnenge, want'hu nawaone kugamba huhali, kwaviya difumbi dyakwo hedinde na mnt'hu. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Naho kisindo, want'hu nawakuswese. Zuwa idyo ita hadya wakefisaga mwe mbuli ino umwo yandile hainati, ukakefise he kiumbiko cha maiwe. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Miye nenilase misale mitatu mnk'handa nk'handa kwa kugamba naonyekeza ahadya. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Niyo nenimtume mbwanga aite akaizungule misale iyo. Nna mgamba ‘Kaula imisale iyo iyaho wili, iguhe, ivo nounde na utondowazi,’ weye nawe noukelavilize hant'hu ukefisile, kwaviya naika kilapi kwa Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi, kugamba nounde na utondowazi haheina uwihi wowose. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Mna nnamgamba, ‘Kaula, misale ihale ya aho,’ uhalawe aho, kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu naande aunga unyilikile hale. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Kuligana ne vilapi kiikilane, Zumbe Mnungu naa kikaule vileke kise kujala kilapi chetu mazua yose.”<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Ivo, Daudi niyo akefisa mwo mgunda. Mwo lupisi lwe kinyemi cho kulawa kwo mnenge kize kibule, seuta Sauli ekekala vileke adye. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Enga ivo azoele, seuta ekekala mwe difumbi dyakwe dyandile hagihi no lukandula. Yonasani niyo ekala kulongole kwakwe, Abineli naye ekalaga hagihi na seuta. Mna hant'hu ha Daudi handaga hahana mnt'hu. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Mwe dizuwa idyo Sauli halongaga dyodyose, kwaviya nakafanyanya kugamba Daudi nakapata ubanike hegu yehe hazumilwe kunda mwe kinyemi icho. <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Mwe dizuwa dya kaidi dye kinyemi cho kulawa mnenge, hant'hu ha Daudi handaga hahana mnt'hu. Sauli niyo amuuza mwanawe Yonasani, “Nii Daudi mwana ywa Yese hezile mwo kudya nk'hande gulo na dyelo?”<verse eid="1SA 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Yonasani niyo amhitula, “Anilombezaga vitendese nimlekele aite Betelehemu. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />Anilombezesaga akagamba, ‘Nilekele nileke niite kwa wandugu zangu, kwaviya wadamanya nt'hambiko uko kwo mzi, naho ndugu yangu anigamba niite uko. Uneva kunizumila nilekele niite kwa wandugu zangu.’ Nivo vilekile hahali aha ho kudya nk'hande hamwenga na seuta.”<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Aho Sauli niyo anda na maya mwa Yonasani, na kumgamba, “Weye mwana ywa mvele asaguke naho mnk'hani! Himanya kugamba kumsagula mwana ywa Yese kwa soni zako mwenye, na kumgela soni nyokwe! <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Togola humanyize kugamba Daudi akanda mgima, weye houpate luneka lwa kunda seuta ywe isi ino? Haluse ita ukamlete aha hangu, kwaviya vaungwa akomigwe.”<verse eid="1SA 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Yonasani niyo amwihitula, “Nii akomigwe? Kabangai?”<verse eid="1SA 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Mna Sauli niyo amduila mjungo Yonasani vileke amkome. Aho niho Yonasani abunk'hulaga kugamba kindedi ise andaga akaunga amkome Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Aaho Yonasani akanda na maya yatendese, ahalawaga, naho hadyaga nk'hande yeyose zuwa idyo dya kaidi dye kinyemi cho kulawa umnenge. Yonasani engilaga kinyulu vitendese mwa Daudi kwaviya ise amgelaga soni. <verse eid="1SA 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Luvi mtondo, Yonasani aitaga kudya kwo mgunda, akadugane na Daudi enga ivo walagane. Aitaga uko hamwenga na mbwanga yumwenga. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Eze abule uko amgambaga yudya mbwanga ywakwe, “Guluka ukaizungule imisale iyo nenitoe.” Yudya mbwanga umwo andaga akaguluka, Yonasani alasaga msale niyo womboka halanga ho mtwi wakwe wa uyo mbwanga. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Yudya mbwanga eze abule aho msale ugwele, Yonasani niyo amwitanga, “Msale ukulongole kwako. <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Sunguza, usekukimala hant'hu aaho ni aho.” Yudya mbwanga aduganyaga misale na kumwigaila zumbe ywakwe. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />Mna yudya mbwanga hamanyaga chochose mwa udamanyi uwo. Wamanyaga ni Yonasani na Daudi du. <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Yonasani niyo amwik'ha yudya mbwanga vitoanilo vakwe na kumgamba “Ita uuye kwo mzi.”<verse eid="1SA 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Ivo yudya mbwanga eze ahalawe, Daudi niyo enuka na kulawa hant'hu akefisaga hagihi ne kiumbiko cha maiwe. Afunamizaga mtwi hasi ha ha Yonasani nk'hanana nt'hatu kwa kumtunya. Wose waidi Daudi na Yonasani wakekumbatilaga na kuila. Daudi andaga na usungu kujink'ha Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Ivo Yonasani niyo amgamba Daudi, “Genda mp'heho. Kiika kale kilapi kwa Zina dya Zumbe Mnungu akikaule mazuwa yose vileke kisekujala kilapi, mwe vyeleko vako na vyeleko vangu.” Daudi niyo enuka na kuita, Yonasani naye auyaga kwo mzi.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Daudi anyilikila uko Nobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Daudi niyo aita kwa mlavant'hambiko Ahimeleki uko Nobu. Ahimeleki afosaga amsingile akazingiza, na kumuuza, “Nii kwiza aha weye ukedu?”<verse eid="1SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Daudi niyo amwihitula, “Ni yaha viligane na ivo seuta alongile. Anigambaga nisekumgambila mnt'hu yeyose mwe mbuli idya anisigiile. Hilagana na want'hu wangu kugamba kibwilane hant'hu. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Togola una kint'hu chochose cho kudya? Nakulombeza mikate mishano hegu chochose kiyaho.”<verse eid="1SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Mlava nt'hambiko Ahimeleki amgambaga, “Aha nna mikate heikudigwa ni mnt'hu yeyose. Mikate nnanayo ni idya mikate ikukile du. Mwadaha kwink'higwa mikate iyo ikanda want'hu wako hawagendile na wavele mwa mazua aya ya hagihi.”<verse eid="1SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Daudi niyo amgamba mlavant'hambiko, “Ikindedi, umwo kikaita kwe nk'hondo wavele wandaga hale na suwe! Uneva want'hu wangu wakuka kikanda mwe ndima zizoelwe, togola hevinde vitendesa mwe ndima ino ikuungwa?”<verse eid="1SA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Ivo mlavant'hambiko Ahimeleki niyo amwink'ha mikate iyo ikukile, kwaviya hakwandaga na mikate mituhu, yandaga ni iiyo du yaikagwa ha Zumbe Mnungu kwe Dihema dikukile, ivo niyo yasakanywa na mikate mihya kulawa kwe diziko.<verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Ivo mwe dizuwa idyo handaga na mndima ywa Sauli akuvika ha Zumbe Mnungu. Mndima uyo etangagwa Doegi kulawa Muedomu, kilongozi ywa wadimi wa Sauli.<verse eid="1SA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Daudi niyo amgamba Ahimeleki, “Togola una sime hegu mjungo ukudaha kunink'ha? Kwaviya ndima za seuta zinitenda nisunguze kuhalawa, miye name nehihalawa haheina sime yangu hegu vitoanilo vovose.”<verse eid="1SA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Ahimeleki niyo amhitula, “nnanayo isime ya Mfilisiti Goliati uyo umkomile mwe dikolongo dya Ela, ikunyuma ye kizibau cha mlavant'hambiko inyinyigwe mwa kasodo. Uneva waunga uguhe haya guha kwaviya hahana sime nt'huhu.” Daudi niyo amgamba, “Hahana sime enga iyo, nakulombeza unink'he.”<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />Niyo Daudi akanda agendeela kumnyilika Sauli, na kuita kwa mlavant'hambiko Akishi ywa Gati. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />Wandima wa seuta niyo wamgamba Akishi, “Uyu hiyo Daudi, seuta ywe isi ya Izilaeli? Togoleni hiyo uyu wakagambana mwo wila, ‘Sauli kakoma maelufu ya want'hu na Daudi kakoma milongo elufu ya want'hu?’”<verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />Ulosi uwo wamtendaga Daudi ande na wengele, niyo amwogohesa seuta Akishi ywa Gati. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Ivo niyo aketendaga enga mkilalu, akakwangula kwangula mwa mwe zi nyivi naho malevu yakwe yandaga yaketika mwe zindevu zakwe. <verse eid="1SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Akishi niyo awagamba wandima wakwe, “Mmanya kugamba mnt'hu uyu mkilalu, nii mumleta kwangu? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Togoleni mnigaila mnt'hu uyu mkilalu kwaviya hina wakilalu aha? Hikumuunga mnt'hu uyu engile mwe nyumba yangu?”<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Walavant'hambiko wachinjigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />Daudi ahalawaga uku akagulukila mwe mp'hanga hagihi na mzi wa Adulamu. Wakuluze na wanduguze watuhu weze weve kugamba andaga aho, wose wagendaga kulungana naye. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Want'hu wose wandaga na makunt'ho, na wadya wandaga wakatigizwa, na wadya wandaga na usungu mwe mioyo yawe walunganaga na Daudi. Kwa umwenga wawe wandaga want'hu magana mane. Yehe naye andaga kilongozi ywawe.<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Kulawa uko, Daudi aitaga mpaka Mizipa mwe isi ya Moabu, Akamgamba seuta ywa Moabu, “Nakulombeza, tate na mnala wekale aha hako mpaka nimanye Mnungu naanitendelei.” <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Ivo, Daudi awalekaga welesi wakwe wekale na seuta ywa Moabu, woho nawo wekalaga uko. Kwa lupisi ulo lwose Daudi andaga kakefisa kwe mp'hanga.<verse eid="1SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Niyo mlotezi Gadi amgambaga Daudi, “Usekwikala aha he mp'hanga, halawe aaha wiite mwe isi ya Yuda.” Ivo Daudi niyo ahalawa, na kuita mwe mbago ya Heleti.<verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Zuwa dimwenga, Sauli andaga Gibea, ekalaga hasi yo mkwazu mwo mnima, uku akanda na mjungo wakwe mwo mkono na wandima wakwe wandaga wakimala mnk'handa mwakwe. Ivo agambilagwa kugamba Daudi na want'hu wakwe waoneka. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Sauli naye niyo awagamba wandima wakwe, “Haluse nyuwe want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini nitegelezeni, togoleni mwafanyanya kugamba uyu Daudi naawenk'heni kila yumwenga mgunda wa zabibu? Hegu kugamba nawatendeni kunda watoani wa maelufu hegu wakulu wa watowani wa want'hu magana? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Nii nyuwe nyose mnda na mzungu mwa miye? Hehali hata yumwenga akunigambila mbuli ino, mwo lupisi mwanangu akaika Ndagano na mwana Yese. Naho nii hahali hata yumwenga ywenu ana kinyulu hegu mwanangu mwenye amsonk'heleza mndima ywangu mwa miye na kuninyatila enga ivi dyelo?”<verse eid="1SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Naho Doegi kulawa Muedomu uyo akimalaga hagihi na wandima wa Sauli akagamba “Nehimuona mwana wa Yese akeza Nobu kwa mlavant'hambiko Ahimeleki mwana ywa Ahitubu. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Ahimeleki niyo amlombezela Daudi kwa Zumbe Mnungu na kumwink'ha nk'hande na idya sime ya Mfilisiti Goliati.”<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Seuta Sauli niyo amsigiila mlavant'hambiko Ahimeleki mwana Ahitubu hamwenga ne mp'huga ya ise awo wandile walavant'hambiko uko Nobu, wetangwe. Wose niyo wamwitila seuta Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Sauli niyo agamba, “Haluse tegeleza weye mwana Ahitubu.” Ahimeleki niyo amhitula, “Haya mkulu.”<verse eid="1SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Sauli niyo amgamba, “Nii weye na Daudi mwana Yese mnda hamwenga mwo mzungu mwa miye? Nii nokumwink'ha mikate na sime, naho niyo wamlombezela kwa Zumbe Mnungu? Haluse kanihituka naho anongola vileke anikome.”<verse eid="1SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Ahimeleki niyo amhitula seuta, “Mwa wandima wako Daudi ni kuhuwilwa kujink'ha wose. Yehe ni mkwe mnima ywako weye seuta, yehe ni mkulu ywa wamizi wakukwamila, naho atunywa kujink'ha wose mwe kaya yako. <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Dielo hiyo nk'hanana ya bosi kumlombeza Mnungu kwaajili yakwe. Seuta usekunifanyanya miye hegu mnt'hu yeyose mwe mp'huga ya tate mwo mzungu uwo. Miye mndima ywako, himanyize dyodyose dinde kulu hegu dodo mwe mbuli iyo.”<verse eid="1SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Mna seuta Sauli niyo amgamba, “Ahimeleki ikindedi noukomwe weye hamwenga na mp'huga yako na ya iso.” <verse eid="1SA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Sauli niyo awagamba wamizi wakwe wakumwamila, “Hitukeni na kuwakoma walavant'hambiko wa Mnungu kwaviya woho wazumilana na Daudi, nawamanya kugamba anyilikaga mna woho hawanigambile.” Mna wamizi awo hawenulaga mikono yawe vileke wawakome walavant'hambiko wa Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="1SA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Kwaivo seuta Sauli amgambaga Doegi, “Weye hituka ukawakome walavant'hambiko.” Doegi kulawa Edomu aitaga na kuwakoma walavant'hambiko wose, zuwa idyo, Doegi awakomaga walavant'hambiko milongo mnane na shano awo wakuvala vizibao ving'aile. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Naho niyo awakoma kwa sime wakaya wose wa Nobu, mzi wa walavant'hambiko, wavele na wagosi, wana wadodo na wank'honk'ha, ng'ombe na mp'hunda na ngoto.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Mna Abiazali, yumwenga ywa wana kilume ywa Ahimeleki mwana ywa Ahitubu, eze anyilike aitaga kwa Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Abiazali amgambaga Daudi ivo Sauli awakomaga walavant'hambiko wa Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Naye Daudi niyo amgamba Abiathali, “Nehimanya du mwe dizuwa diya namuonaga Doegi kulawa Edomu kugamba naamgambile Sauli. Ivo ni miye niwahosile want'hu we mp'huga yako wakomwe. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Weye kikalanye naho usekogoha kwaviya Sauli aunga akikome miye na weye, kinandanya na miye houkomwe.”<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Daudi auyokola mzi wa Keila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Niyo Daudi agambigwa, “Tegeleza, Wafilisiti wakump'hukila mzi wa Keila naho wawahoka want'hu nk'hande ihetigwe mwe viwasa va kuhetela.” <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />Ivo Daudi niyo amuuza Zumbe Mnungu, “Togola, niite hawatowe Wafilisiti?” Zumbe Mnungu niyo amhitula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:2">“Heye, ita ukawatowe Wafilisiti na kuukombola mzi wa Keila.”<verse eid="1SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Mna want'hu wa Daudi niyo wamgamba, “Uneva kinanda aha Yuda chogoha, neinde vivihi elo kinaita Keila na kuwatowa watowani wa Wafilisiti?” <verse eid="1SA 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Daudi niyo amlombeza naho Zumbe Mnungu, naye niyo amgamba, “Inuka wiite Keila kwaviya neniwatendeni muwahume Wafilisiti.” <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Ivo Daudi niyo aita Keila hamwenga na want'hu wakwe, naho uko niko watowanaga na Wafilisiti, na kuwakoma Wafilisiti wabindile wingi na kutaha ng'ombe zibindile wingi. Ivo Daudi awakombolaga want'hu wa Keila.<verse eid="1SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />Abiathali mwana wa Ahimeleki, eze agulukile kwa Daudi uko Keila, aitaga ne kazibao kwo ulavant'hambiko.<verse eid="1SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Sauli eze agambilwe kugamba Daudi kabula kale Keila, agambaga, “Mnungu kanink'ha udahi wa kumkoma kwaviya kakekindila mwenye kwa kwingila mwo mzi una gomela dina mihindo.” <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Ivo, Sauli awetangaga watowani waite Keila na kukump'hukila, vileke wamzunguluke Daudi hamwenga na want'hu wakwe.<verse eid="1SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Daudi eze eve mizungu yawe iyo ihile mwa yehe, amgambaga mlavant'hambiko Abiathali, “Kalete aha ako kazibau kwo ulavant'hambiko.” <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Niyo Daudi amlombeza akagamba, “Zumbe Mnungu ywa Izilaeli kindedi miye mndima ywako, hiva kugamba Sauli eza kuubalanga mzi wa Keila kwaviya miye ni mwo mzi uno. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Togola wakaya wa Keila nawanink'hize kwa Sauli? Togola Sauli eza kindedi enga ivo niivile miye mndima ywako? Weye Zumbe Mnungu ywa Izilaeli, nakulombeza unihitule miye mndima ywako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:11">Zumbe Mnungu niyo amhitula, “Sauli neeze.”<verse eid="1SA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Daudi niyo amuuza, “Togola wakaya wa Keila nawaninink'hize kwa Sauli, miye hamwenga na want'hu wangu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:12">Zumbe Mnungu niyo amhitula, “Nawakwink'hize kwa Sauli.”<verse eid="1SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Niyo Daudi na want'hu wakwe awo wandile magana mtandatu, wahalawaga na kuita hohose wadahaga kuita. Sauli eze eve kugamba Daudi kahalawa Keila, niyo aileka mizungu yakwe yose.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi mwe isi ya vigulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />Ivo, Daudi asigalaga kwe digomela mwe dijangwa, mwe isi ye vigulu kwe zinyika za Zifu. Sauli amzungulaga kila zuwa, mna Mnungu hamwink'hile Sauli udahi wa kumgwila Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Zuwa dimwenga umwo Daudi andaga hagihi na Holeshi evaga kugamba Sauli andaga akaita Zifu akamzungula vileke amkome. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Yonasani mwana Sauli ambasaga Daudi uko Holeshi akamgela ludole akamgamba, “Utoge, Mnungu akwamila.” <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />Yonasani amgambaga, “Usekogoha, tate Sauli haakupate. Weye nounde seuta ywa Izilaeli, miye neninde ywa kaidi kwako. Hata tate Sauli kamanya mbuli ino.” <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />Awo wose waidi, wadamanyaga Ndagano ha Zumbe Mnungu. Daudi niyo asigala mwo mzi wa Holeshi na Yonasani niyo aita kwe kaya yakwe.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Sauli akanda akei uko Gibea, want'hu wa Zifu wambasaga na kumgamba, “Daudi akefisa mwe isi yetu mwe digomela uko Holeshi, mwo mnima Hakila, wili hant'hu ha Kwa mwenye mzi ya Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />Haluse seuta, soo kwetu naswe nekidamanye vovose vileke kimgwile na kumwigala kwako.”<verse eid="1SA 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Sauli niyo awahitula, “Nyuwe kindedi mwanionela mbazi na Zumbe Mnungu awavikileni. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Iteni naho mkamanye aho akukefisila naho niani amuone hant'hu aho, kwaviya higambilwa yehe ni mbala vitendese. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Sinyiseni kila hant'hu mmanye aho akefisile, niyo mwanigaila ulosi ukint'hile. Naho neniite hamwenga na nyuwe naho uneva akei mwe isi iyo, miye nenimzungule mwa maelufu ya want'hu wa Yuda.”<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Ivo, wenukaga na kuita Zifu, wakamlongoela Sauli. Mwo lupisi ulwo Daudi na want'hu wakwe wandaga mwe nyika ya Maoni, mwe dikolongo dya Alaba Kwa mwenye mzi ya Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Sauli na want'hu wakwe wakongaga kumzungula Daudi. Mna Daudi eze agambilwe mbuli izo, agendaga kukefisa mwo luwe, niyo ekala mwe zinyika za Maoni. Sauli eze eve mbuli izo, amzungulaga Daudi mwe nyika izo. <verse eid="1SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Sauli na want'hu wakwe nawanda nt'hendelo ya kagulu ka luwe, Daudi naye na want'hu wakwe nawanda nt'hendelo int'huhu ya kagulu ka luwe. Umwo Daudi andaga akusunguza kunyilika na want'hu wakwe, watowani wa Sauli wandaga hagihi na kumgwila. <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />Aho mnt'hu yumwenga amwitilaga Sauli na kumgamba, “Sunguza uuye Wafilisiti waitoa isi.” <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Ivo Sauli niyo aleka kumtimila Daudi na kugenda kutoana na Wafilisiti. Nivo vilekile hant'hu aho haketangwa, Sela Hammahlekoth, nuko kugamba Luwe lwa kupangana. <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Daudi ahalawaga hant'hu aho, na kugenda kwikala mwe mp'hanga yo mzi wa Engedi.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Daudi aleka kumkoma Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Sauli eze auye kulawa kwe nk'hondo na Wafilisiti, agambilagwa kugamba Daudi eyuko kwe nyika za Engedi. <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Niyo Sauli awaguha watoani alufu nt'hatu awo wandile wedi hewekogoha mwe isi yose ya Izilaeli, niyo wagenda kumzungula Daudi na want'hu wakwe mwo luwe wa mbuzi mwitu. <verse eid="1SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Sauli umwo andaga akaita, nakabula mwe mp'hanga imwenga imgihi mwe didewa dya ngoto na kwingila umwo, vileke azunguluke. Daudi na want'hu wakwe nawanda wekala kundani mwe mp'hanga iyo. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />Want'hu wa Daudi niyo wamgamba, “Diya dizuwa akugambile Zumbe Mnungu kugamba nohutende uwahume kwa wank'hondo wako. Weye nawe nouwatendele ivo nouunge. diyelo zuwa idyo dibula.” Niho Daudi amwitilaga Sauli kwa kinyele kwa kunyuma, na kukant'ha kalebetu ke divalo dyakwe. <verse eid="1SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Daudi niyo akonga kunda na kinyulu mwo moyo wakwe kwaviya akant'haga kalebetu ke divalo dya Sauli kwa kinyele. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />Nakawagamba want'hu wakwe, “Henimtendele mbuli ino zumbe ywangu seuta kwaviya yehe kasagulwa kwa kukumbigwa mavuta kwajili ya Zumbe Mnungu. Henimtowe kwaviya yehe kakumbigwa mavuta ni Zumbe Mnungu ande seuta.” <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Kwa ulosi uwo, Daudi awalemezaga want'hu wakwe wase kumtowa Sauli. Niyo Sauli akimala na kufosa mwe mp'hanga na kugendeela ne nt'hambo yakwe. <verse eid="1SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Daudi niyo enuka na kufosa mwe mp'hanga na kumwitanga Sauli, “Zumbe ywangu seuta!” Seuta Sauli eze akaule kunyuma, Daudi afunamaga mpaka hasi kwa kumtunya. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Niyo amgamba, “Nii wawategeleza want'hu wakukugamba Daudi aunga akulumize? <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Haluse kaula, dyelo kukeonela mwenye, umwo wandile mwe mp'hanga, Zumbe Mnungu nakanink'ha udahi wa kukugwila. Want'hu wangu wanigambaga hukome, mna nehikuleka hagamba hehukome, kwaviya kusagulwa ni Zumbe kunda seuta. <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Tate kaula kalebetu ke suke yako nnanako mwe mikono yangu. Kwa kukant'ha kalebetu ke suke yako haheina kukukoma, ni kindedi kugamba miye hina masa yoyose kwako naho hisaguke mna weye wanongola vileke unikome. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />Zumbe Mnungu asengele mwa miye na weye, naho Zumbe anilihizile kwako mna miye heni geze kukulumiza. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Kumbukila ulosi wa kale ukugamba ‘Kwa mnt'hu mwiihi kwalawa wiihi.’ Mna miye henikutowe. <verse eid="1SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />Haluse weye seuta ywa Izilaeli kaula mnt'hu ukuunga kumkoma! Togola wamzungula ani? wazungula kuli difile hegu watimila boi! <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />Ivo Zumbe Mnungu ande mlamuzi mwa weye na miye. Yehe naakaule mbuli ino, naanigombele na kuniyokola kulawa kwako.”<verse eid="1SA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Daudi eze ibinde kulonga, Sauli niyo agamba, “Togola izwi idyo dyako weye mwanangu Daudi?” Sauli niyo ailisa. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />Niyo amgamba Daudi, “Weye uywedi kujink'ha miye. Weye kunitendela yedi, mna miye hikutendela yaihile. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Dyelo kulagisa ivo wili ywedi kwangu, kwaviya hunikomile, hamwenga na kugamba Zumbe nakakwink'ha udahi wa kunikoma. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Togola, mnt'hu anamgwila mnk'hondo wakwe naamleke aite iviivi du? kwa diya unidamanyile dielo, Zumbe akutendele ayedi! <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />Haluse himanya kugamba kindedi nounde seuta ywa Izilaeli, na useuta ywa Izilaeli noutogezwe mwe isi yako. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Mna niikile kilapi kwa Zumbe kugamba houwause want'hu wangu, hegu kuusa zina dyangu mwe mp'huga ya tate.” <verse eid="1SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Daudi niyo akelisa kwa Sauli. Sauli niyo auya kwe kaya yakwe, mna Daudi na want'hu wakwe niyo waita hant'hu hawe ha kukefisa.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s">File ya Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Ivo Samweli abanikaga, na Waizilaeli wose waduganaga vileke wamhongezele na kummosela msanga kwe kaya yakwe uko Lama.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1SA 25:1">Daudi na Abigaili</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:1">Niyo Daudi aita kwe nyika za Palani. <verse eid="1SA 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Nokunda na mnt'hu yumwenga uko kwo mzi wa Maoni uyo andaga na uchuuzi wakwe wa ngoto mwo mzi wa Kalimeli. Uko adimaga ngoto zakwe na kuzikant'ha mazoya. Andilisaga mgoli, andaga na ngoto alufu nt'hatu na mbuzi alufu imwenga. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Mnt'hu uyo etangwagwa Nabali mkaziwe naye etangwagwa Abigaili. Abigaili mmanyi naho mta futa yedi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:3">Mna Nabali andaga mnt'hu aihile naho mnk'hani, uyo andaga ywo lukolo lwa Kalebu. <verse eid="1SA 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Ivo, Daudi akanda kwe nyika evaga kugamba Nabali andaga akakant'ha ngoto zakwe mazoya uko Kameli. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Ivo atumaga wabwanga mlongo akawagamba, iteni kwa Nabali uko Kameli mkamgambe Daudi akulamsa. <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />Nomumgambile kugamba. “Daudi akulamsa, utondowazi unde kwako, ne mp'huga yako yose iyo unanayo. <verse eid="1SA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />Hiva kugamba wazikant'ha mazoya zingoto zako, naunga umanye wadimi wako nawanda hamwenga na suwe, suwenaswe hekiwabanange. Naho lupisi lwose wandile hamwenga na suwe mwo mzi wa Kameli, hakiwabaile ngoto yoyose. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Unawauza nawakugambile, haluse nakulombeza wabwanga wangu awa wapate uwagilwa hako, kwaviya kibula mwo lupisi lwa kinyemi. Nakulombeza uwenk'he chochose icho unanacho wandima wako awa na miye mwanao Daudi.”<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Wadya wabwanga wa Daudi nawagenda kumgambila Nabali enga ivo wasigiilwe ni Daudi. Woho niyo wanda kugoja. <verse eid="1SA 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Nabali niyo awagamba wandima wa Daudi, “Daudi niye ani? Mwana wa Yese niye yuhi? Mazuwa aya weyuko wandima wengi wakuwasumka wakulu wawe. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Togola niguhe mikate yangu, na mazi na nyama izo nichichinjile kwajili ya wakant'ha mazoya ye zingoto zangu na kuwenk'ha want'hu hiiwamanyize ukwo wakulawa!”<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Ivo wadya wabwabga wa Daudi nawauya na kumgambila Daudi yose enga ivo wahitulwe ni Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />“Ivo Daudi niyo awagamba want'hu wakwe!” kila mnt'hu akekake sime yakwe mwe kigudi. Naho kila mnt'hu niyo akekaka sime yakwe, Daudi naye iviaivia niyo akekaka sime. Naho want'hu wakubula magana mane wamtimilaga Daudi na want'hu magana maidi wasigalaga ne zint'hanu.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Mbwanga yumwenga ywa Nabali, amgambilaga Abigaeli mkaza Nabali, “Daudi atumaga want'hu kulawa kwe nyika vileke wamlamse mkulu ywetu, mna yehe awahomolaga. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Mna want'hu awo nawanda wedi kwetu, hawakibeile naho lupisi lwose aho chandile nawo uko kwe nyika hachaswesaga chochose. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Kwetu nawanda enga wamizi kilo na msi lupisi lwose chandile kikadima ngoto. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Haluse fanyanya mwe mbuli ino naho ukaule dyo kudamanya. Mbuli ino yadaha kwigala kint'hu kiihile kwa mkulu ywetu na kwa wambuyaze wose. Kwaviya yehe ni mnt'hu aihise naho hahali akudaha kulonga naye” <verse eid="1SA 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Abigaili adamanyaga nguzu, aguhaga mikate magana maidi na mabeti maidi ya divai, ngoto shano zikasigwe vedi, kilo mlongo na mfungate za mkazingo, vikwanya gana va zabibu zinyaile, na mikate ya tini magana maidi na vint'hu ivi vose avikwezaga mwe mp'hunda. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Niyo amgamba yudya mbwanga ywakwe, “Longola, miye nohutimile.” Mna hamgambile dyodyose mgosiwe.<verse eid="1SA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Umwo andile akaseela, kakwela mp'hunda yakwe na kukindilwa no mnima, aaho niyo wabwiilana na Daudi na want'hu wakwe wakeza uuko akulawa. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Daudi naakafanyanya mwo moyo, “Miye nehinda hamila ugoli wose wa Nabali kwe nyika haihena upati wowose, naho hahana kint'hu chochose chagile, naho yehe kaniliha yaihile kwa uwedi nimtendele. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Mnungu anikome miye uneva luvi kukacha neninde hinati niwakome wagosi wose we kwakwe.”<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Abigaili eze amkaule Daudi, aseelaga kulawa mwe mp'hunda yakwe, na kufunama ha Daudi, kihanga chakwe niyo chabula hasi. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Akeduulaga heviga ha Daudi niyo amgamba, “Mkulu, masa yose yande mwangu miye mndima ywako. Nakulombeza utegeleze mbuli akukugambila mndima ywako. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Nakulombeza mkulu, usekumfanyanya Nabali uyo mnt'hu aihile, enga ivo dili dizina dyakwe Nabali, nivo naye eli. Yehe etangwa Nabali, naho yehe ni mnt'hu mhezi. Mkulu, wadya wabwanga wako weyaho hadya uwasigiile, miye mndima ywako hiwaone. <verse eid="1SA 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />Haluse zumbe ywangu, nakelisila kwa Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu kakukindila usekulihiza kwa kwitila sakame na kukepatila lema, waleke wank'hondo wako na wadya wose wakukuungila yaihile wande wahezi enga Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Mkulu nakulombeza uhokele geleko idi hwigaile naho uwenk'he wabwanga ukuwalongoza weye mkulu. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />Nakulombeza uniusile masa, miye mndima ywako. Zumbe naaitende mp'huga yako itogile kwaviya weye mkulu watoana nk'hondo ya Zumbe. Naho wiihi houoneke mwako mazua yose. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Kunalaila want'hu wakukutimila na kuunga kubananga wikazi wako, Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywako naakwamile weye hamwenga na wagima. Mna wikazi wa wank'hondo naauduule hale, enga viya mnt'hu akuduula iwe kwa nk'humbaiwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Naho neinde Zumbe Mnungu akeza kwajika kukudamanyila yose ayedi akulagane, na kukusagula kunda kilongozi ywa Izilaeli, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />weye mkulu, houone vihile, kwa kulihiza wiihi. Naho Zumbe akeza kukudamanyila ayedi, nakulombeza usekunijala miye mndima ywako.”<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Daudi niyo amgamba Abigaili, “Atunywe Zumbe Mnungu ywa Izilaeli uyo akusigiile kudugana na miye dielo. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Uvikilwe weye no umanyi wink'higwe kwa kunikindila miye dielo nisekukoma, hegu kukelihiza miye mwenye. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Kwa kindedi Zumbe Mnungu ywa Izilaeli kanikindila nisekukulumiza. Wandile hwasunguze kudugana na miye, kwa kindedi luvi mtondo hegu hakwandile na mgosi yeyose naakasigala kwa Nabali na want'hu wakwe.” <verse eid="1SA 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Akajika Daudi niyo ahokela vint'hu vose ivo Abigaeli amwigaile, na kumgamba, “Uya kaya kwako kwa utondowazi. Kaula miye hiva yadya ulongile na malombezo yako hiyahokela.” <verse eid="1SA 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Abigaili eze auye kaya, ambwiilaga Nabali akadamanya wila mwe kaya yakwe enga seuta. Nabali andaga kelelwa vitendese mwo moyo wakwe kwaviya andaga kakolwa. Ivo Abigaili hamgambile dyodyose mpaka mtondo. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Kuze kuche Abigaili eze amkaule mgosiwe kaleukwa, amgambilaga mbuli zose, aaho Nabali etukaga niyo mwili wakwe akugutalaga vihile. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Mwe dizuwa dya mlongo Zumbe Mnungu amtowaga naho Nabali na kubanika.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Daudi eze eve Nabali kabanika agambaga, “Atunywe Zumbe Mnungu amlihize Nabali kwa kunihomola, naho Zumbe Mnungu kanihonya miye mndima ywakwe kudamanya wiihi. Zumbe Mnungu kamsengela Nabali kwa wavu wakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:39">Niyo Daudi asigiilaga want'hu vileke amlongele lusona Abigaili ande mkaziwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Wandima wa Daudi weze wabule kwa Abigaili uko Kameli, wamgambaga, “Daudi kakisigiila kikuguhe unde mkaziwe.”<verse eid="1SA 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Abigaili enukaga na kufunama hasi hakwe akagamba, “Miye ni mndima du, hizumila kusunt'ha iviga va wandima wa mkulu.” <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Abigaili asunguzaga kwinuka na kukwela mwe mp'hunda yakwe, na kutimilana na wandima wakwe we kivele washano na kuita na wandima wa Daudi, yehe naye niyo anda mkaza Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 25:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />Naho Daudi amlombaga Ahinoamu kulawa Yezeli. Ivo wose awo niyo wanda wakaziwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Mwo lupisi ulo Sauli andaga kamloza mwanawe Mikali uyo andaga mkaza Daudi, kwa Paliti mwana ywa Laishi kulawa mzi wa Galimu.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s">Daudi aleka naho kumkoma Sauli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />Ivo awo wagosi kulawa mzi wa Zifu nawaita kwa Sauli uko Gibea niyo wagamba, Daudi andaga akakefisa mwo mnima wa Hakila, nt'hendelo ya ulailo wa zuwa wa Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Ivo Sauli afosaga niyo aita kwe zinyika za Zifu akanda na watowani alufu nt'hatu hewekogoha kulawa Izilaeli vileke wakamzungule Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Sauli niyo aika nk'hambi mwo mnima wa Hakila kwe sila ya ulailo wa zuwa wa Yeshimoni. Mna Daudi aitaga uko kwe nyika, eze amanye kugamba Sauli amzungula, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />atumaga wapelembi, na kugambilwa kugamba ni kindedi. <verse eid="1SA 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Daudi niyo afosa, na kuita hant'hu Sauli aikaga nk'hambi. Na kuhaona hant'hu Sauli agonaga na Abineli mwana ywa Neli, mkulu ywa watowani wa Sauli, andaga kagona wakanda hagihi na Sauli. Naho Sauli agonaga hagatigati ye nk'hambi uku akazungulukwa ni watowani wakwe.<verse eid="1SA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Daudi niyo amgamba Ahimeleki uyo Mhiti, na Abishai nguguye Yoabu, nuko kugamba nine etangwagwa Seluya, “Niani nekiitanye hamwenga kwe nk'hambi ya Sauli?” Abishai amgambaga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:6">“Nekiitanye na miye.”<verse eid="1SA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Nekilo, Daudi na Abishai wengilaga mwe nk'hambi ya Sauli, na kumbwiila Sauli kagona hagati ye nk'hambi iyo, na mjungo wakwe usomekwa hasi yo mtwi wakwe. Abineli hamwenga na watowani nawagona kumzunguluka Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Abishai amgambaga Daudi, “Dielo Mnungu kamwiika mnk'hondo mwo udahi wako. Ivo nelekele nimuwambe mwe sanga no mjungo kamwenga du, naho henivuzagize!”<verse eid="1SA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Mna Daudi niyo amgamba Abishai, “Usekumkoma, kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu namsengele mnt'hu yeyose naageze kumkoma mndima ywakwe asagulwe kwa kukumbigwa mavuta. <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />Himanya ikindedi kugamba, Zumbe Mnungu mwenye naamkome Sauli, mafani kwo lupisi lwakwe lwo kubanika hegu umwo akaita kwe nk'hondo. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Mna Zumbe anikindile nnase kugeza kumkoma mndima ywa Zumbe uyo asagulwe kwa kukumbigwa mavuta. Mna kiguhe mjungo wakwe wi hagihi no mtwi wakwe hamwenga ne didumu dya mazi niyo chakeitila.” <verse eid="1SA 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Ivo, Daudi aguhaga udya mjungo ne didumu dya mazi hagihi no mtwi wa Sauli niyo wakeitila. Mna hakwandaga na mnt'hu aone hegu amanyize mbuli iyo, naho hahali enuke mwe zint'hongo, kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu awatendaga wagonese.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Niyo Daudi aita nt'hendelo ya kaidi ye dikolongo idyo, na kukimala hale ne difyo dya Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Na kuditanga kwa izwi difyo dya Sauli na Abineli mwana ywa Neli akagamba, “Abineli, togola, waniiva? Abineli niyo auza,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:14">“Weye ni weani ukumwitanga seuta?”<verse eid="1SA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Daudi niyo amhitula, “Togola weye hiyo mgosi? Niani aligane na weye mwe Izilaeli? Nii humwamile mkuluwo seuta? Kwaviya mnt'hu yumwenga engilaga aho vileke amkome mkuluwo seuta! <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Idyo udamanye hiyo mbuli yedi. Enga ivo eli Mnungu, mwaungwa kubanika, kwaviya hamwamile mkulu ywenyu, uyo Zumbe Mnungu amwiikile kwa ndima. Haluse kaula, mjungo wa mkuluwo hamwenga ne didumu dyakwe uneva viyaho?”<verse eid="1SA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Sauli abunk'hulaga izwi dya Daudi, niyo amuuza, “Togola, idyo hiyo izwi dyako mwanangu Daudi?” Daudi niyo amhitula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:17">Heiye mkulu seuta izwi idyo dyangu. <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Niyo agendeela kulonga, “Mna nii, weye mkulu wagendeela kunitimila miye mndima ywako? Hibangai? Ni wiihi wani hudamanyile? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Haluse, mkulu seuta, wive mbuli za mndima ywako. Uneva ni Zumbe Mnungu akutendile wize unitowe, haya ahokele nt'hambiko neikutende uhitule fanyanyi zakwe vileke uleke kunitimila. Mna uneva ni want'hu, haya, Zumbe Mnungu awaligite want'hu awo kwaviya wanigulusa kulawa mwo ukipe akink'hile Zumbe Mnungu wakagamba niite haidamanyile ndima milungu mituhu. <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Usekunileka nibanikile mwe isi ya wata kwiza, hale na Zumbe Mnungu, nii weye seuta ywa Izilaeli kulawa uzungule ugima wangu enga mnt'hu akongola nk'wale mwo mnima?”<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Naho Sauli ahitulaga, “Miye hidamanya wiihi. Daudi mwanangu uya. Henikutendele kint'hu kiihile naho kwaviya dielo ugima wangu unda hi wa bule kwako, miye hinda mhezi naho hibanangisa!”<verse eid="1SA 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Daudi niyo ahitula, “Weye mkulu, mjungo wako uno wiaha, msigile mtowani ywako yumwenga eze auguhe. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />Zumbe Mnungu amliha kila mnt'hu mhuwilwa na muwagilwa. Dyelo Zumbe nakakuika mwo udahi wangu, mna miye hikutendile kint'hu chochose kwaviya weye kuikwa kwa ndima ya Mnungu. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Kaula, enga ivi dyelo hikukomile, Zumbe Mnungu anitendele iivo anihonye na makunt'ho yangu yose!”<verse eid="1SA 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Sauli niyo amgamba Daudi, “Mnungu akuvikile mwanangu Daudi. Noudamanye mbuli nk'hulu, naho nounde mhumi.” Ivo, Daudi niyo akeitila, Sauli naye niyo auya kwe kaya yakwe.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s">Daudi ekala kwa Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Mna Daudi afanyanyaga akagamba, “Diuko zuwa dimwenga Sauli naanikome. Kint'hu chedi cha kudamanya ni kunyilikila kwe isi ya Wafilisiti. Sauli naafe chevu kunizungula mwa Waizilaeli, aho niho nenikale kwa utondowazi.” <verse eid="1SA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Ivo Daudi ahalawaga yehe na want'hu magana mtandatu wandaga hamwenga naye no kuita kwa Akishi mwana Maoki seuta ywa mzi wa Gati. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Daudi hamwenga na want'hu wakwe ne mp'huga yakwe nawekala na Akishi uko kwo mzi wa Gati. Naho Daudi nakanda na wavele waidi, Ahinoamu ywa Yezileeli na Abigaili uyo mgosiwe Nabali ywo mzi wa Kalimeli abanikaga. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Sauli eze eve kugamba Daudi kanyilikila kwo mzi wa Gati, alekaga kumwogola.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Zuwa dimwenga, Daudi amgambaga Akishi, “Uneva kunizumila, nakulombeza unink'he mzi umwenga mwe mizi yako miye nikale uko. Hiyo vedi miye nikale na weye mwo mzi uno akwikala seuta.” <verse eid="1SA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Ivo mwe dizua idyo Akishi amwink'haga Daudi mzi wa Zikilagi, naivo mzi uwo niyo wandaga ugoli wa maseuta wa Yuda kukongela mwo lupisi ludya. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Daudi ekalaga mwe isi ya Wafilisiti kwa lupisi lwa mwaka umwenga na miezi mine.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Mwo lupisi ulwo, Daudi na want'hu wakwe wawatowaga Wageshuli na Wagilizi na Waamaleki na awo wandile wakaya we isi iyo kukongela aho nk'hongo. Awatowaga kukongela Talemu kuhinga Shuli mpaka kwe mihaka ya Misili. <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Kila umwo Daudi autowaga mzi wowose hasigazaga hata mnt'hu yumwenga kunda mgima akanda mgosi hegu mvele na kutaha ngoto na ng'ombe na mp'hunda na ngamia na mavalo, niyo auya na kwa Akishi. <verse eid="1SA 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Uyo Akishi amuuzaga Daudi, “Diyelo ink'hondo kutowa hii?” Daudi amhitulaga kwa kuziga kugamba, nehinda Kwa mwenye mzi ya Yuda hegu Kwa mwenye mzi ya Wayelameeli hegu Kwa mwenye mzi ye isi ya Wakeni. <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Daudi hamlekaga mnt'hu yeyose kunda mgima akanda mgosi hegu mvele vileke wegalwe mwo mzi wa Gati, afanyanyaga kugamba, sema wanalonge ikindedi kugamba Daudi adamanyaga mbuli ino hegu idya. Ivo nivo Daudi andaga akadamanya mwo lupisi lwose ekale kwa Wafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Kwa ivo Akishi amhuwilaga Daudi akafanyanya kugamba, “Daudi kanda hakuungiswa ni want'hu wa Izilael, ivo naande mndima ywangu aha mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Mwo lupisi lutuhu, Wafilisiti nawaduganya watowani wawe wakatowane na Waizilaeli. Akishi niyo amgamba Daudi, “Waungwa umanye kugamba weye na watowani wako mwaungwa mnde watowani wangu.”<verse eid="1SA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Daudi niyo amhitula Akishi, “Heiye nouone kint'hu mndima ywako naadamanye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:2">Akishi niyo amgamba, “Weye ni weye nounamile miye mwenye.”<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli aita kwa wagangana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Mwo lupisi ulu, Samweli andaga kabanika, naho Waizilaeli wose nawanda wamhongezela kale na kummosela msanga uko kwo mzi wakwe uko Lama. Sauli andaga kawagulusa walotezi na wagangana mwe isi.<verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Wafilisiti wakeduganyaga na kuika nk'hambi yao uko Shunemu, Sauli naye awaduganyaga Waizilaeli wose na kuika nk'hambi yao kwo mnima wa Giliboa. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Sauli eze akaule watowani wa Wafilisiti ogohesaga na kunda na lukeng'ent'ha. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Hata eze amlombeze Zumbe Mnungu, Zumbe Mnungu hamhitule kwa sozi hegu kwa maiwe ya kuzungula ulosi wa Mnungu yakwitanwa Ulimu hegu kwa sila ya walotezi. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Niho Sauli awagamba wandima wakwe, “Nizunguileni mvele mgangana vileke niite akanikawiile mnamulo.” Wandima wakwe niyo wamhitula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:7">“Eyaho mgangana yumwenga uko Edoli.”<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Ivo, Sauli niyo aavala mavalo matuhu vileke asekumanyika kugamba ni seuta, aitaga uko hamwenga na want'hu wakwe waidi. “Wabulaga nekilo kwa uyo mvele mgangana, akamgamba nikawiile mnamulo naho umlete mwe isi, mnt'hu yeyose huunga hugambile.”<verse eid="1SA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Yudya mvele niyo amgamba, “Weye kumanya icho adamanye seuta Sauli, kawausa walotezi na wagangana wose mwe isi ya Izilaeli. Haluse nii wanitegela vileke unigwile na kunikoma?”<verse eid="1SA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Sauli niyo amgamba, “Nakelisa kwa zina dya Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi, hokulaile kint'hu chochose kiihile kwako mwe mbuli ino.”<verse eid="1SA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Yudya mvele niyo amuuza, “Togola hwigaile ani kulawa uko kwe isi ya wabanike?” Sauli niyo ahitula, “Nigaile Samweli.”<verse eid="1SA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Yudya mvele eze amuone Samweli, agutaga na kumgamba Sauli, “Nii kunidant'ha? weye ni seuta Sauli!”<verse eid="1SA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Seuta Sauli niyo amgamba, “Usekogoha!” “Waona mbwai?” Yudya mvele niyo amhitula, “Naona muye akulaila mwe isi.”<verse eid="1SA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Sauli niyo amgamba mvele, “Ni mliganyizo wa ani? Yudya mvele niyo amgamba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">“Mgosi adalahale akezinganize valo akwela kulanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Aho Sauli niyo akombaganya kugamba uyo ni Samweli. Sauli niyo afunamiza mtwi mpaka hasi kwa kumtunya.<verse eid="1SA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Samweli niyo amgamba Sauli, “Nii wanisulumiza kwa kunikweza uku?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:15">Sauli niyo amhitula, “Miye nina mank'huto makulu! Wafilisiti watowana nk'hondo na miye, naho Mnungu kanileka, naho hanihitule hata kwa sila ya walotezi hegu kwa sozi. Naivo higamba hwitange vileke unilagise dyo kudamanya.”<verse eid="1SA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Samweli niyo agamba, “Nii waunga hwambize mna Zumbe kakuleka naho kanda mnk'hondo ywako? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" />Zumbe Mnungu kakudamanyila kiya alongaga kwa kombokela miye. Zumbe kauhausa useuta wako, naho kamwink'ha Daudi uyo mnk'hondo wako. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" />Kwaviya hutimile yadya alongile Zumbe Mnungu, naho huwakomile pele Wamaleki na kila kint'hu wandile nacho enga ivo alongile Zumbe. Nivo vilekile Zumbe Mnungu kakudamanyila ivo. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />Hamwenga na ayo, Zumbe Mnungu naakutende weye na Waizilaeli wose mhumwe ni Wafilisiti naho luvi weye na wanao nomnde hamwenga na miye, naho watowani wa Izilaeli nawahumwe ni Wafilisiti.”<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Aaho, Sauli akanda na wogohi kwajili ye zimbuli alongile Samweli agwaga kifulifuli, naho handaga na ludole lwolwose, kwaviya hadyaga kint'hu chochose kilo na msi. <verse eid="1SA 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Naho yudya mvele aitaga kwa Sauli naho eze akaule kugamba Sauli andaga na wogohi vitendese, amgambaga, “Miye mndima ywako nadaha kubanika kwaviya hikutendela kiya unigambile hudamanyile. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Haluse, nitegeleze miye mndima ywako, nohudamanyile cho kudya ludodo unde na ludole vileke uuye uko ulawile.” <verse eid="1SA 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Mna Sauli alemelaga na kugamba, “Henidye.” Mna wadya wandima hamwenga na yudya mvele wamhembelezaga adye, naye niyo awategeleza. Ivo enukaga no kwikala mwo lusazi. <verse eid="1SA 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Yudya mvele andaga na kadama kakwe kamwenga kwe kaya kagimbale, niyo akachinja. Aguhaga unga we ngano, niyo oka mkate hougeligwe ugwadu. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Na kumwink'ha Sauli, hamwenga na wandima wakwe, woho nawo niyo wadya na kukonga nt'hambo kilo icho.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s">Wafilisti wamlemela Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Wafilisiti waduganyaga mafyo ya watowani wakwe wose uko Afeka, na Waizilaeli nawaika nk'hambi uko kwe nch'hoko ye dikolongo dya Yazeleli. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Wakulu washano wa Wafilisiti umwo wakomboka na mafyo yawe ya watowani magana na maalufu, Daudi naye hamwenga na want'hu wakwe, hamwenga na Akishi, wandaga wakatimila kwa kunyuma mwe difyo idyo dya Wafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Naho wakulu wa watowani wa Wafilisiti wauzaga, “Awa Waibulania wadamanyai aha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 29:3">Akishi naye niyo awagamba wakulu wa watowani wa Wafilisiti, “Uyu ni Daudi andaga mndima ywa Sauli seuta ywa Izilaeli, haluse ubula mwaka umwenga na nusu akanda na miye kukongela aho wapanganaga na Sauli seuta ywa Izilaeli. Miye hione wiihi wowose kwakwe.”<verse eid="1SA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Mna wakulu watowani wa Wafilisiti wandaga na maya mwa Akishi, niyo wamgamba, “Mvuze uyu mnt'hu, auye kudya kunt'hu umwink'hile, naho umgambe asekuita na suwe kwe nk'hondo chaivo mwo lupisi lwe nk'hondo naakihituke na kunda mnk'hondo ywetu. Hukuona kugamba mnt'hu uyu naapate sila yedi ya kwiivana na mkuluwe kwa kuwakoma watowani wetu? <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Togola, uyu hiyo Daudi uyudya wavele wakemile mbuli zakwe wakavina uku wakagamba, ‘Sauli kakoma maalufu, mna Daudi kakoma maalufu mlongo.’”<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Akishi niyo amwitanga Daudi na kumgamba, “Nakelisila kwa Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi, kugamba kunda mhuwilwa kwangu. Neinda mbuli yedi kwangu kiite wose waidi kwe nk'hondo, kwaviya hione dyodyose diihile kwako kukongela hadya wizile kwangu mpaka dyelo ino. Hata ivo, wakulu hawakuzumile weye. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Ivo haluse uya kaya kwa utondowazi sema una waihiye wakulu wa watowani wa Wafilisiti.”<verse eid="1SA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Daudi niyo amgamba Akishi, “Mna hibanangai? Enga ivo ukulonga kugamba, hunione na masa yeyose kukongela zuwa diya nakongaga kukudamanyila ndima mpaka dyelo, nii kugenda kutowana nk'hondo na watowani wa mkulu?”<verse eid="1SA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Akishi niyo amgamba, “Himanya kugamba huna masa yeyose hangu enga mtumigwa ywa Mnungu. Hata ivo, wakulu wa watowani wa Wafilisiti watigiza kugamba, Asekugeza kuita hamwenga na suwe kwe nk'hondo. <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Haluse, weye Daudi na wandima wa mkuluwo Sauli mkelauke kilokilo mhalawe.”<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Ivo kilokilo zuwa ditimile, Daudi hamwenga na want'hu wakwe nawauya mwe isi ya Wafilisiti. Mna awo Wafilisiti wakwelaga kuita Yazileeli.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s">Daudi awakoma pele Waamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Mwe dizuwa dya katatu, Daudi na want'hu wakwe wauyaga Kwa mwenye mzi ya Yuda. Wamaleki wandaga waitowa kale Kwa mwenye mzi ya Yuda hamwenga no mzi wa Sikilagi na kuoka moto. <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />Wandaga wawataha wavele na want'hu wose wandile mwo mzi uwo, wakulu kwa wadodo. Awo watahigwe wahalawaga nawo wakanda wagima, haheina kumkoma mnt'hu yeyose. <verse eid="1SA 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Daudi na want'hu wakwe weze wabule mwo mzi wabwiilaga mzi wokwa moto, wavele wawe na wanawe we kilume na we kike watahigwa. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Naho Daudi na want'hu wakwe weze watule ndilo, wailaga niyo wasokela.<verse eid="1SA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />Wavele waidi wa Daudi, Ahinoamu kulawa Yazeli na Abigaili uyo andaga mkaziwe Nabali, woho nawo watahagwa.<verse eid="1SA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Haluse, Daudi andaga mwe makunt'ho makulu kwaviya want'hu wakwe wandaga na usungu mwe miyoyo yawe kwa kwaza wanawe, ivo wakanda kumtisa kwa kumtowa maiwe. Mna Daudi akeink'ha moyo kwa kumhuwila Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="1SA 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />Daudi niyo amgamba mlavant'hambiko Abiatali mwana Ahimeleki, “Lete kasuke ka ulavant'hambiko. Abiatali niyo amwigaila. <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />Daudi niyo amlombeza Zumbe Mnungu akagamba, togola niditimile fyo dya watahi awo? Naho togola neniwabwiile uko kwe sila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:8">Naye niyo ahitula, “Watimile, kindedi noubwiile na kuwakombola awo watahigwe.”<verse eid="1SA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Ivo, Daudi niyo ahalawa hamwenga na want'hu magana mtandatu awo andile nawo. Weze wabule mwe kazuto ka Besoli, wamwenga wawe wasigalaga aho. <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />Mna Daudi agendeelaga kuditimila difyo idyo akanda na want'hu magana mane, na want'hu magana maidi wasigalaga aho kwaviya wasokelaga vitendese, hawadahaga kudendeluka mwe kazuto ako. <verse eid="1SA 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Wadya want'hu wandaga na Daudi wambwilaga mnt'hu yumwenga Mmisili mwe nyika, woho nawo wamwigalaga kwa Daudi. Mnt'hu uyo hadyaga chochose hegu kunywa mazi kwa lupisi lwa mazuwa matatu, kilo na msi. <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />Naho wamwink'haga mnt'hu kabesu kwo mkate na mkate wa tini na vikwasa viidi va zabibu zinyaile. Eze ibinde ukudya, apataga ludole. <verse eid="1SA 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Daudi niyo amuuza, “Mkuluwo niani? Naho kulawahi?” Yehe niyo amgamba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:13">“Miye ni mbwanga wa Misili. Ni mtumwa ywa Mmaleki yumwenga. mkulu anilekaga mazuwa matatu yomboke kwaviya nehinda mnyonge. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Suwe nekitowa mizi ya Wakeleti imwe nt'hendelo ya Yuda ne mizi ye nk'holo za Kalebi, na kuwoka mzi wa Sikilagi.”<verse eid="1SA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Daudi niyo amuuza, “Togola, wadaha kunigala mwe difyo idyo dya watahi?” yudya mbwanga niyo amhitula, “Uneva noukelisile kwa zina dya Mnungu kugamba hounikome, hegu kunivuza kwa mkulu, nohwigale.” <verse eid="1SA 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Yudya mbwanga amlongozaga Daudi mpaka kudya wandaga watahi. Weze wabule uko wabwiilaga wasambala kila hant'hu kwaviya wandaga wadya na kunywa, kwaviya vint'hu watahaga kulawa kwa Wafilisiti ne isi ya Yuda zandaga zibinda wingi. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Daudi atowanaga nawo kukongela kilokilo mpaka kisingi. Hahandaga na mgosi yeyose ahonile, vituhu vakwe ni wadya wabwanga magana mane wakwile ngamia na kuguluka. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />Daudi ayokolaga kila kint'hu chatahagwa na Wamaleki, hata na wavele wakwe waidi. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Chochose chandile cha kwawe, kikanda kidodo hegu kikulu, mwana kike hegu ywa kilume, Daudi awakombolaga. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Naho Daudi ayavuzaga mafyo ya ngoto na ngombe na want'hu wakwe wakasaka mifugwa iyo, wakailongoza kulongole ye mifugwa mituhu wakagamba, “Ivi ni vitahigwa va Daudi.”<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Daudi niyo awauwiya wadya want'hu magana maidi awo walekagwa kwa kazuto ka Besoli kwaviya wandaga wasokela kumtimila. Wadya want'hu weze wamuone Daudi na hamwenga na wadya wandile hamwenga naye, waita kuwasingila. Daudi eze abule hagihi na want'hu awo, awalamsaga. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Mna want'hu wose wank'hani na waihile mwa want'hu wamtimile Daudi, wakagamba, “Hakiwenk'he want'hu awa vitahigwe vose kikombole kwaviya hawaitile hamwenga na suwe. Ivo wawaguhe wavele wawe na wana wawe, vileke wakeitile.”<verse eid="1SA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Daudi niyo amgamba, “Hiyo ivo ndugu zangu. Homdahe kudamanya ivo kwaviya Zumbe niye akink'hile vitahigwa ivo. Achamilaga vedi, na kuwatenda kiwahume wank'hondo wetu. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Hahali mnt'hu naawazumileni mwe zifanyanyi zenyu izo! Yudya aitile kwe nk'hondo na yudya asigale na nt'hanu zetu, kila mnt'hu neenk'higwe viligane.” <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Daudi atendaga kihendo icho cho kupangilana viligane ivo vint'hu vitahigwe inde sigilizi, naho yatimilwa ni Waizilaeli kukongela aho mpaka dyelo.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Daudi eze auye Sikilagi, awaigailaga wambwiyaze, awo wadala wa Yuda, mwa viya vitahigwe akagamba, “Nawegaila mageleko ya vitahigwe mwa wank'hondo wa Zumbe Mnungu.” <verse eid="1SA 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Mageleko ayo yandaga kwaajili ya wakaya wa Beteli, na wakaya wa Lomoti ya Kwa mwenye mzi ya Yuda, na wakaya wa Yatili, <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />na wakaya wa Aloeli na wakaya wa Sifomoti na wakaya wa Eshitemoa, <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />wakaya wa Lakali na wakaya we mizi ya Wayelameeli na wakaya we mizi ya Wakemi, <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />wakaya wa Holima na wakaya wa Bolashani na wakaya wa Atahaki, <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />na wakaya wa Hebuloni. Daudi awegailaga naho wakaya we mizi yose iyo yehe na want'hu wakwe wandaga wakaitalamkila.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s">File ya Sauli na mwanawe ywe kilume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Ivo, Wafilisiti nawatowana nk'hondo na Waizilaeli mwo mnimna Giboa na Waizilaeli wengi nawakomigwa uko mna Sauli na wanawe na Waizilaeli watuhu wanyilikaga. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Mna Wafilisiti wandaga wakamzungulisa Sauli na wanawe, niyo wawakoma Yonasani na Abinadamu na Malikishua awo wana Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Nk'hondo yatendesaga kwa Sauli. Wadya wakulasa ne misale weze wamuone wamlasaga niyo wamlumiza vihile. <verse eid="1SA 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Naho Sauli amgambaga mnt'hu enule vitowanilo, “Somola isime yako unikome, vileke want'hu awa hewevinilwe seka wakanikoma na kunibela.” Mna uyo enule vitowanilo va Sauli haungile kwaviya nakogohesa. Ivo, Sauli aguhaga sime yakwe mwenye na kuketungiza mwenye. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Naho yudya enule vitowanilo eze akaule Sauli kabanika, na yehe niyo agweela sime yakwe, yehe naye niyo abanika <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Ivo nivo Sauli abanike, na wanawe wa tatu, no mnt'hu enule vitowanilo hamwenga na want'hu wakwe wose mwe dizuwa idyo. <verse eid="1SA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Na Waizilaeli wandile nt'hendelo ya kaidi ye dikolongo, na watuhu wandile ulailo wa zuwa yo mto Yolodani weze waone kugamba Waizilaeli wanyilika, Sauli naye na wanawe wabanika, wasamaga mwe mizi yawe niho Wafilisiti wagendaga kwikala mwe mizi iyo.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Luvi yakwe, Wafilisiti weze waite na kuguha vint'hu va wakomigwe nawabwiila vimba va Sauli na wanawe mwo mnima Giliboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Wakant'haga mtwi wa Sauli na kuviguha vint'hu vakwe, niyo wawasigiila wegala ulosi mwe isi yawe yose ya Filisiti wakabwelekeze mbuli yedi ye file ya Sauli mwe zinyumba za mahili yawe na kwa want'hu. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Viya vitowanilo nawaviika mwe zinyumba za Maashitaloti, niyo wahweelaza kimba chakwe mwo lukandula lwo mzi wa Beti Shani.<verse eid="1SA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Mna wakaya wa mzi wa Yabeshi Gileadi, weze weve Wafilisiti ivo wamtendile Sauli,<verse eid="1SA 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />watowani wadahi wose nawahalawa, na kugenda choo pwii, wauusaga kimba cha Sauli na vimba va wanawe kulawa mwo lukandula lwa Beti Shani, niyo weza navo mpaka Yabeshi na kuvoka. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Akajika, niyo waguha mavuha yawe na kuimosa msanga hasi yo mkwazu uko Yabeshi, woho nawo niyo wafunga kwa mazuwa mfungate.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>